(7317125, 1141791, 30490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I am always drawn in by these circular stairways that have interesting textures.  Maybe because I live in a place that doesn''t have a building higher than 3 stories!  Ha ha, no stairways for me to shoot in my home town!</td>', 'Nice composition. I am always drawn in by these circular stairways that have interesting textures.  Maybe because I live in a place that doesn''t have a building higher than 3 stories!  Ha ha, no stairways for me to shoot in my home town!', '2015-02-15 02:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
