(7317128, 1141552, 30490, '<td valign="top">Love the title and very interesting subject!  They look like they are praying to the sun in a "child''s pose" from yoga or in a mosque.<br/> <br/>Very unique capture and a good fit for the challenge.</td>', 'Love the title and very interesting subject!  They look like they are praying to the sun in a "child''s pose" from yoga or in a mosque. Very unique capture and a good fit for the challenge.', '2015-02-15 02:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317129, 1141023, 30490, '<td valign="top">A unique perspective.  Nice image.  It is hard to capture white birds and not have the feather detail all blown out.  I like the texture in the water at the head of the bird too. (can''t tell if a swan, goose or a white duck)</td>', 'A unique perspective.  Nice image.  It is hard to capture white birds and not have the feather detail all blown out.  I like the texture in the water at the head of the bird too. (can''t tell if a swan, goose or a white duck)', '2015-02-15 02:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317130, 1141798, 30490, '<td valign="top">Ewww, but so cooool!  That is one hairy chin too! Nice macro shot of a camel I''m guessing.  This one is compelling and very interesting!</td>', 'Ewww, but so cooool!  That is one hairy chin too! Nice macro shot of a camel I''m guessing.  This one is compelling and very interesting!', '2015-02-15 02:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
