(7317245, 1141395, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looking at the thumbnail, this appeared to simply be a snapshot. Upon a better look at the full image, there is an awful lot going on here and several different stories about this family and their upcoming day. <br/> <br/>I''m not sure this fits my personal definition of art, but very good, nonetheless. Extra pointage for making me stop and look closer.</td>', 'Looking at the thumbnail, this appeared to simply be a snapshot. Upon a better look at the full image, there is an awful lot going on here and several different stories about this family and their upcoming day.  I''m not sure this fits my personal definition of art, but very good, nonetheless. Extra pointage for making me stop and look closer.', '2015-02-15 14:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317246, 1141954, 83313, '<td valign="top">Using the abstract art title generator?</td>', 'Using the abstract art title generator?', '2015-02-15 14:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
