(7317758, 1141261, 32011, '<td valign="top">Now THIS is my type of art.  I can EASILY see this hanging on a wall in my office or at home.  Composition and processing is perfect - I love the clarity, the light reflections on the wings, the deformation in the upper-wing skin and the horizontal tail alluding the ribs and spars below that allow this beautiful creature to take flight.  What once was a tool for war, death and destruction, is now just a thing of beauty and awe - as we appreciate the ingenuity of the men and women that created these birds, and the brave souls that used them in the service of their nation.</td>', 'Now THIS is my type of art.  I can EASILY see this hanging on a wall in my office or at home.  Composition and processing is perfect - I love the clarity, the light reflections on the wings, the deformation in the upper-wing skin and the horizontal tail alluding the ribs and spars below that allow this beautiful creature to take flight.  What once was a tool for war, death and destruction, is now just a thing of beauty and awe - as we appreciate the ingenuity of the men and women that created these birds, and the brave souls that used them in the service of their nation.', '2015-02-16 21:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317761, 1141404, 32011, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful image.  I love it.  The balance, the detail, the colour... AMAZING.  The goat on the left appears to be real, at the same time looking like art on the wall behind.  The  old man, whose face is as worn as the stone he sits on.  This clothes and possessions adding to the mystery of the story told by the scene.  I want to meet this man.  I want to visit this place.  I want to know what he has in the bundle on his lap, and in his bag.  THIS is art!!!  I would HAPPILY hang this on a wall.  Thank you for making my life better by sharing this image with me.</td>', 'This is a wonderful image.  I love it.  The balance, the detail, the colour... AMAZING.  The goat on the left appears to be real, at the same time looking like art on the wall behind.  The  old man, whose face is as worn as the stone he sits on.  This clothes and possessions adding to the mystery of the story told by the scene.  I want to meet this man.  I want to visit this place.  I want to know what he has in the bundle on his lap, and in his bag.  THIS is art!!!  I would HAPPILY hang this on a wall.  Thank you for making my life better by sharing this image with me.', '2015-02-16 21:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317765, 1141261, 83313, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.. Tough one. I love vintage warbirds, and I <i>would</i> hand something like this on my wall. I guess it IS art, then.</td>', 'Hmmm.. Tough one. I love vintage warbirds, and I would hand something like this on my wall. I guess it IS art, then.', '2015-02-16 22:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317767, 1141480, 83313, '<td valign="top">Ok, <b><i>THIS</i></b> is cool looking!</td>', 'Ok, THIS is cool looking!', '2015-02-16 22:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317771, 1141148, 12253, '<td valign="top">Commenting only: I like the grain here, the subject is interesting enough...I see a story that she''s leaving.  I don''t personally think the OOF blur is necessary or effective here though, especially with such a closeup.  Perhaps further back a lensbaby style blur would be interesting to me.  Or midway back...maybe motion blur...she''s leaving!</td>', 'Commenting only: I like the grain here, the subject is interesting enough...I see a story that she''s leaving.  I don''t personally think the OOF blur is necessary or effective here though, especially with such a closeup.  Perhaps further back a lensbaby style blur would be interesting to me.  Or midway back...maybe motion blur...she''s leaving!', '2015-02-16 22:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317772, 1141732, 12253, '<td valign="top">Commenting only: I find this a pretty humorous juxtoposition.  Well seen and caught.  Overall it works pretty well, though I think I might like it better if the girl were looking at the bird, and perhaps with a bit better fidelity.</td>', 'Commenting only: I find this a pretty humorous juxtoposition.  Well seen and caught.  Overall it works pretty well, though I think I might like it better if the girl were looking at the bird, and perhaps with a bit better fidelity.', '2015-02-16 22:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317773, 1141798, 12253, '<td valign="top">Commenting only: I think this is great.  Not so appealing, but that''s irrelevant.  I like the colors, the concept, and the nice details.</td>', 'Commenting only: I think this is great.  Not so appealing, but that''s irrelevant.  I like the colors, the concept, and the nice details.', '2015-02-16 22:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317774, 1141616, 12253, '<td valign="top">Commenting only: I really like the concept, and the silhouettes especially as they appear posed (or candid).  The composition is a bit too towards the edge to me, especially since the low-fi look of the sky makes it less appealing as a sunset photo.  I know people went low-fi for the challenge, but this would be great with a little more breathing room and higher production values.</td>', 'Commenting only: I really like the concept, and the silhouettes especially as they appear posed (or candid).  The composition is a bit too towards the edge to me, especially since the low-fi look of the sky makes it less appealing as a sunset photo.  I know people went low-fi for the challenge, but this would be great with a little more breathing room and higher production values.', '2015-02-16 22:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317781, 1141600, 12253, '<td valign="top">Commenting only: I am a fan of this motion blur effect, and this is pretty well done.  The color contrasts are most interesting here.</td>', 'Commenting only: I am a fan of this motion blur effect, and this is pretty well done.  The color contrasts are most interesting here.', '2015-02-16 23:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317790, 1141404, 12253, '<td valign="top">Commenting only: Stunning image, well processed with what I presume is an added texture.  In any case, it''s like a beautiful painting!</td>', 'Commenting only: Stunning image, well processed with what I presume is an added texture.  In any case, it''s like a beautiful painting!', '2015-02-16 23:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317812, 1142058, 108069, '<td valign="top">Very well seen and framed. A grand, assorted doodle of all shapes and sizes and colors, tethered to shore by a very real line. Great photo.</td>', 'Very well seen and framed. A grand, assorted doodle of all shapes and sizes and colors, tethered to shore by a very real line. Great photo.', '2015-02-17 00:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317813, 1141931, 108069, '<td valign="top">A massive drain pipe leading to a baby carriage should be illegal! Very well processed to get these great tones. A pleasure of a scene. Nicely done.</td>', 'A massive drain pipe leading to a baby carriage should be illegal! Very well processed to get these great tones. A pleasure of a scene. Nicely done.', '2015-02-17 00:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317814, 1142035, 108069, '<td valign="top">Strong photo, so very well composed. A single character and focal point, and yet stories galore. Nicely done.</td>', 'Strong photo, so very well composed. A single character and focal point, and yet stories galore. Nicely done.', '2015-02-17 00:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317817, 1141876, 108069, '<td valign="top">The Burgh! Very nice perspective. There is some haloing from the tone-mapping that detracts just a bit and might hurt this very momentary appraisal of this image. And a landscape like this might be doomed in an art challenge anyway, but it''s a great scene, and composed really well to get some great light off the ice and the foreground rocks.</td>', 'The Burgh! Very nice perspective. There is some haloing from the tone-mapping that detracts just a bit and might hurt this very momentary appraisal of this image. And a landscape like this might be doomed in an art challenge anyway, but it''s a great scene, and composed really well to get some great light off the ice and the foreground rocks.', '2015-02-17 00:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317818, 1141106, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great capture. I''ve gone back through the calender, my e-mails, text messages, facebook -- all of it -- and I do not see any indication that I was invited to this. Please remedy that.</td>', 'Great capture. I''ve gone back through the calender, my e-mails, text messages, facebook -- all of it -- and I do not see any indication that I was invited to this. Please remedy that.', '2015-02-17 00:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317820, 1141800, 108069, '<td valign="top">Can I join him? Wormwood is quite nice. Great photo as well. I keep staring at that tree on the far left, and looking at it long enough I''m in the field, in peace, the calm.</td>', 'Can I join him? Wormwood is quite nice. Great photo as well. I keep staring at that tree on the far left, and looking at it long enough I''m in the field, in peace, the calm.', '2015-02-17 01:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317824, 1141046, 37858, '<td valign="top">Good color and focus on the center of the image; less so on the hub.  While I appreciate that you may have wanted the nearest part to be out of focus, I think that detracts from an otherwise fine image.</td>', 'Good color and focus on the center of the image; less so on the hub.  While I appreciate that you may have wanted the nearest part to be out of focus, I think that detracts from an otherwise fine image.', '2015-02-17 01:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317825, 1142044, 37858, '<td valign="top">I like everything about this image, especially the white drape of her skirt, except for the shadow/dark around her face and hair.  These seem to be partially lost against the black background.  Still, my overall response is favorable.</td>', 'I like everything about this image, especially the white drape of her skirt, except for the shadow/dark around her face and hair.  These seem to be partially lost against the black background.  Still, my overall response is favorable.', '2015-02-17 01:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317826, 1141959, 37858, '<td valign="top">I was going to write a detailed analysis of your image, its message and it''s place in art history, but my Buddha nature got the best of me, so I''ll just score it a 7 and let you figure out the rest.  [Your model reminds me that it is late and time for me to get to bed.]</td>', 'I was going to write a detailed analysis of your image, its message and it''s place in art history, but my Buddha nature got the best of me, so I''ll just score it a 7 and let you figure out the rest.  [Your model reminds me that it is late and time for me to get to bed.]', '2015-02-17 01:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317827, 1141480, 24983, '<td valign="top">clever very well done 7</td>', 'clever very well done 7', '2015-02-17 01:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317828, 1141013, 37858, '<td valign="top">This image evokes a sense of time very well.  I like everything about it except for the fact that the railing behind him appears to be sticking out of his head.  I wish he were one step to the side.  Still, the play of light and dark is nice, the sense of nostalgia is palpable, the balance between the tree and the foreground post is good, and the photograph has an artistic feel to it.<br/> <br/>7</td>', 'This image evokes a sense of time very well.  I like everything about it except for the fact that the railing behind him appears to be sticking out of his head.  I wish he were one step to the side.  Still, the play of light and dark is nice, the sense of nostalgia is palpable, the balance between the tree and the foreground post is good, and the photograph has an artistic feel to it. 7', '2015-02-17 01:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317829, 1141553, 37858, '<td valign="top">I am unsure whether this photo is a bit out of focus or whether my eyes are getting tired, but I think it is the former.  I like the colors, patterns on the hinge and boards, and the rustic feel of the image.</td>', 'I am unsure whether this photo is a bit out of focus or whether my eyes are getting tired, but I think it is the former.  I like the colors, patterns on the hinge and boards, and the rustic feel of the image.', '2015-02-17 01:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317831, 1140995, 37858, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and colors.  It appears that you may have added an artistic filter, but whether that is so or not the image looks to be a bit soft for my preferences.</td>', 'Nice composition and colors.  It appears that you may have added an artistic filter, but whether that is so or not the image looks to be a bit soft for my preferences.', '2015-02-17 02:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317832, 1141250, 37858, '<td valign="top">I like everything about this image except the out-of-focus petals in the front.</td>', 'I like everything about this image except the out-of-focus petals in the front.', '2015-02-17 02:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317834, 1141882, 37858, '<td valign="top">Where I''m from, this is called, "shave" ice, but the attraction is the same.  I like the mid-60s sense of Americana captured in this image. 7</td>', 'Where I''m from, this is called, "shave" ice, but the attraction is the same.  I like the mid-60s sense of Americana captured in this image. 7', '2015-02-17 02:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317835, 1141889, 37858, '<td valign="top">Excellent blur / motion obtained by your choice of shutter speed.  I wish the horizon was level, though.  Overall 7.</td>', 'Excellent blur / motion obtained by your choice of shutter speed.  I wish the horizon was level, though.  Overall 7.', '2015-02-17 02:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317836, 1142001, 37858, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, colors, blur/focus, and vignette.  7</td>', 'I like the composition, colors, blur/focus, and vignette.  7', '2015-02-17 02:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317860, 1141180, 23484, '<td valign="top">This creates an interesting diagonal.</td>', 'This creates an interesting diagonal.', '2015-02-17 07:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317861, 1142074, 23484, '<td valign="top">Great place to break down.</td>', 'Great place to break down.', '2015-02-17 07:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
