(7318955, 1141886, 12611, '<td valign="top">Love the intermediate focus, has a fine urban-mystery feel to it; That thing is ready for Indiana Jones, should he dare to venture around the corner...</td>', 'Love the intermediate focus, has a fine urban-mystery feel to it; That thing is ready for Indiana Jones, should he dare to venture around the corner...', '2015-02-20 14:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7318956, 1142067, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like the fact that the elements are used here each in a subtle manner, with a good bit of "feel like you are there" punch. The sky is mild, the marbled wood is hot, and the grass, now gone to seed, cascades over the boardwalk like a sunbathing lover''s feet- sprawling out into the sand...</td>', 'I like the fact that the elements are used here each in a subtle manner, with a good bit of "feel like you are there" punch. The sky is mild, the marbled wood is hot, and the grass, now gone to seed, cascades over the boardwalk like a sunbathing lover''s feet- sprawling out into the sand...', '2015-02-20 14:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7318959, 1141561, 12611, '<td valign="top">The window gives the illusion that the viewer is seeing beautifully scratched ice on the ground. And while distracted, scenes emerge, like the one in the bottom right hand corner, a mother and child stare into the windy woods, as the foreboding shadows of trees, both real on the glass and conjured in the mind, dance around the whole frame. <br/> One of the best I have seen in this challenge, and I''m not sure my mind will be changed...</td>', 'The window gives the illusion that the viewer is seeing beautifully scratched ice on the ground. And while distracted, scenes emerge, like the one in the bottom right hand corner, a mother and child stare into the windy woods, as the foreboding shadows of trees, both real on the glass and conjured in the mind, dance around the whole frame.  One of the best I have seen in this challenge, and I''m not sure my mind will be changed...', '2015-02-20 14:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7318961, 1142001, 104230, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this. It''s intriguing and moody without seeming too contrived. One of my highest scoring images.</td>', 'I keep coming back to this. It''s intriguing and moody without seeming too contrived. One of my highest scoring images.', '2015-02-20 14:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7318964, 1141965, 61396, '<td valign="top">I like the inertia and complimentary colors are a bonus</td>', 'I like the inertia and complimentary colors are a bonus', '2015-02-20 14:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319003, 1141671, 97225, '<td valign="top">Just love this! It has a horse to begin with and that''s a big plus. But on top of that, the soft, golden light is fabulous and  the pasture almost looks like fairyland. Top 3.</td>', 'Just love this! It has a horse to begin with and that''s a big plus. But on top of that, the soft, golden light is fabulous and  the pasture almost looks like fairyland. Top 3.', '2015-02-20 18:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319004, 1141732, 170018, '<td valign="top">Great title, I like how people are taking heron''s presence for granted. :-)<br/>Also on the first glance chairs look like saxophones. :-)<br/>Interesting image to look at.</td>', 'Great title, I like how people are taking heron''s presence for granted. :-)Also on the first glance chairs look like saxophones. :-)Interesting image to look at.', '2015-02-20 19:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319006, 1141250, 170018, '<td valign="top">Love the petals texture. Wish you came up with a real title though.</td>', 'Love the petals texture. Wish you came up with a real title though.', '2015-02-20 19:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319007, 1141732, 97225, '<td valign="top">Lovely, quirky scene. I love the low resolution.</td>', 'Lovely, quirky scene. I love the low resolution.', '2015-02-20 19:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319008, 1141282, 97225, '<td valign="top">Wonderful drama. Love the stark contrasts and the sky is awesome.</td>', 'Wonderful drama. Love the stark contrasts and the sky is awesome.', '2015-02-20 19:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319009, 1142083, 97225, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! I LOVE that sea!</td>', 'Wonderful! I LOVE that sea!', '2015-02-20 19:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319010, 1141082, 97225, '<td valign="top">The future is here! Wonderful overview - could look at this for hours.</td>', 'The future is here! Wonderful overview - could look at this for hours.', '2015-02-20 19:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319011, 1140964, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful layers, beautiful colours. The presence of the two tiny figures, giving both scale and a point of interest, just makes this scene all the more fabulous. Top 3.</td>', 'Beautiful layers, beautiful colours. The presence of the two tiny figures, giving both scale and a point of interest, just makes this scene all the more fabulous. Top 3.', '2015-02-20 19:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319012, 1141931, 170018, '<td valign="top">How did you like Saint Petersburg? Or is that Lev?<br/>Anyway, fun capture! Always interesting to try to predict person''s reaction after the shot...</td>', 'How did you like Saint Petersburg? Or is that Lev?Anyway, fun capture! Always interesting to try to predict person''s reaction after the shot...', '2015-02-20 19:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319013, 1142083, 170018, '<td valign="top">If it was an expert editing challenge, I imagine Neptune standing on the rock looking at the storm. :-)<br/>Strong composition and rich colors!</td>', 'If it was an expert editing challenge, I imagine Neptune standing on the rock looking at the storm. :-)Strong composition and rich colors!', '2015-02-20 19:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319014, 1141947, 170018, '<td valign="top">Woman''s lip color is standing out in a strange way, but I really like her passionate look.</td>', 'Woman''s lip color is standing out in a strange way, but I really like her passionate look.', '2015-02-20 19:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319015, 1141965, 170018, '<td valign="top">It does look like a monkey! I am really curious how it looks without the swirling, do you happen to have a shot?</td>', 'It does look like a monkey! I am really curious how it looks without the swirling, do you happen to have a shot?', '2015-02-20 19:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319016, 1141137, 170018, '<td valign="top">This tree is really scary! Love B&amp;W.</td>', 'This tree is really scary! Love B&W.', '2015-02-20 19:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319017, 1141849, 170018, '<td valign="top">Very strong mood, enhanced even more with a texture!</td>', 'Very strong mood, enhanced even more with a texture!', '2015-02-20 19:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319018, 1141180, 170018, '<td valign="top">Nice geometry, but foam is not too pretty...</td>', 'Nice geometry, but foam is not too pretty...', '2015-02-20 19:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319019, 1142044, 170018, '<td valign="top">She is very pretty! I would have tried longer exposure may be to capture some movement for more "artsy" feel. :-)</td>', 'She is very pretty! I would have tried longer exposure may be to capture some movement for more "artsy" feel. :-)', '2015-02-20 19:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319020, 1141784, 170018, '<td valign="top">I love the feel of it, very rich!</td>', 'I love the feel of it, very rich!', '2015-02-20 19:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319021, 1141399, 170018, '<td valign="top">You''ve got lucky with that bird! :-)</td>', 'You''ve got lucky with that bird! :-)', '2015-02-20 19:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319023, 1141839, 97225, '<td valign="top">What an awesome studio!</td>', 'What an awesome studio!', '2015-02-20 19:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319024, 1141879, 32011, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful work of aft.  The composition is perfectly balanced. The details, almost hidden, but there for those that take the time to look closely.  I''m intrigued by this place... I want to visit, but at the same time, there''s a mystery to it which makes me wonder if it''s safe.  You''ve made me think... and that''s what art should do.  Well done.</td>', 'This is a wonderful work of aft.  The composition is perfectly balanced. The details, almost hidden, but there for those that take the time to look closely.  I''m intrigued by this place... I want to visit, but at the same time, there''s a mystery to it which makes me wonder if it''s safe.  You''ve made me think... and that''s what art should do.  Well done.', '2015-02-20 20:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319025, 1140962, 32011, '<td valign="top">This a wonderful work of art.  The image is balanced so well, but physically and metaphorically.  Left and right, top and bottom, detail and blurred, light and dark, old and young, colour and tones, matte and gloss... it''s an outstanding example of art.</td>', 'This a wonderful work of art.  The image is balanced so well, but physically and metaphorically.  Left and right, top and bottom, detail and blurred, light and dark, old and young, colour and tones, matte and gloss... it''s an outstanding example of art.', '2015-02-20 20:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319026, 1140979, 32011, '<td valign="top">Has an Ansel Adams feel to it.  Nice composition and processing.  There''s an eerie, haunting feeling to the image... the spikes created by broken branches adds a hint of horror.  Lots of feeling/emotion generated when one stops to take in the image fully... something that the 30 second voters will miss completely, I feel.</td>', 'Has an Ansel Adams feel to it.  Nice composition and processing.  There''s an eerie, haunting feeling to the image... the spikes created by broken branches adds a hint of horror.  Lots of feeling/emotion generated when one stops to take in the image fully... something that the 30 second voters will miss completely, I feel.', '2015-02-20 20:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319027, 1142101, 32011, '<td valign="top">WoW!  This is an amazing image.  Taken the "traditional" beauty of the Ansel Adams forest type image, and made it so much more.  The movement makes it dynamic... alive.  The title adds another dimension, make me go back and notice what was only felt on first viewing.  It''s deep and beautiful.</td>', 'WoW!  This is an amazing image.  Taken the "traditional" beauty of the Ansel Adams forest type image, and made it so much more.  The movement makes it dynamic... alive.  The title adds another dimension, make me go back and notice what was only felt on first viewing.  It''s deep and beautiful.', '2015-02-20 20:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319028, 1142090, 32011, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent entry for the Art of 2014 challenge.  It has a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=60915" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">nixter</a> feel to it, and I rate nixter is one of the most artistic photographers to ever grace the halls of DPC.  I love the composition: on the right the shadowy partial figure in the foreground and the large, shadowy tail of the plane; perfectly balanced by the finer detail and colour of the image on the left... beautifully framed into a polyptic by the window structure.  Add to that, the effects of the sun, reflecting off the paint on the tarmac and highlighting the rain and/or dirt on the glass... wonderful stuff.</td>', 'This is an excellent entry for the Art of 2014 challenge.  It has a  nixter feel to it, and I rate nixter is one of the most artistic photographers to ever grace the halls of DPC.  I love the composition: on the right the shadowy partial figure in the foreground and the large, shadowy tail of the plane; perfectly balanced by the finer detail and colour of the image on the left... beautifully framed into a polyptic by the window structure.  Add to that, the effects of the sun, reflecting off the paint on the tarmac and highlighting the rain and/or dirt on the glass... wonderful stuff.', '2015-02-20 20:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319029, 1141798, 50695, '<td valign="top">art is confrontation. it takes you up so close that you don''t realize you are facing something disgusting. you might even think it''s beautiful. and thinking makes it so.</td>', 'art is confrontation. it takes you up so close that you don''t realize you are facing something disgusting. you might even think it''s beautiful. and thinking makes it so.', '2015-02-20 20:23:53.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(7319030, 1141095, 32011, '<td valign="top">Another excellent example of the art of balance, or contrast.  This is a beautiful image that give so much to the viewer willing to stop and contemplate the juxtapositions presented.  Great entry.</td>', 'Another excellent example of the art of balance, or contrast.  This is a beautiful image that give so much to the viewer willing to stop and contemplate the juxtapositions presented.  Great entry.', '2015-02-20 20:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319031, 1141264, 50695, '<td valign="top">My fair lady, is she Pygmalion or Galatea? Is she real? Is any of it real? You''ve taken me someplace where I don''t know. Thank you.</td>', 'My fair lady, is she Pygmalion or Galatea? Is she real? Is any of it real? You''ve taken me someplace where I don''t know. Thank you.', '2015-02-20 20:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319032, 1141561, 50695, '<td valign="top">gorgeous delirium</td>', 'gorgeous delirium', '2015-02-20 20:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319033, 1141385, 50695, '<td valign="top">a suitable Surrealist collage, with just that hint of warmth that keeps it real</td>', 'a suitable Surrealist collage, with just that hint of warmth that keeps it real', '2015-02-20 20:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319035, 1141540, 50695, '<td valign="top">me, too</td>', 'me, too', '2015-02-20 20:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319036, 1141849, 32011, '<td valign="top">A beautiful image, that would not be out of place on a gallery wall, or on an album cover.</td>', 'A beautiful image, that would not be out of place on a gallery wall, or on an album cover.', '2015-02-20 20:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319037, 1141013, 50695, '<td valign="top">wonderful use of exposure to get all the forms in light and darkness. the overexposed lightness has a magical quality. the forms pulled out of darkness also have a magical quality. the two magics create one spell.</td>', 'wonderful use of exposure to get all the forms in light and darkness. the overexposed lightness has a magical quality. the forms pulled out of darkness also have a magical quality. the two magics create one spell.', '2015-02-20 20:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319038, 1141206, 32011, '<td valign="top">Beautiful architecture art.  The contrasts and details are superb, and the composition is fantastic.</td>', 'Beautiful architecture art.  The contrasts and details are superb, and the composition is fantastic.', '2015-02-20 20:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319039, 1141954, 50695, '<td valign="top">excellent title makes me love the whole thing</td>', 'excellent title makes me love the whole thing', '2015-02-20 20:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319040, 1142022, 50695, '<td valign="top">channeling that famous sports artist with your highly saturated reflections. well done.</td>', 'channeling that famous sports artist with your highly saturated reflections. well done.', '2015-02-20 20:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319041, 1142090, 50695, '<td valign="top">gorgeous light, beautiful clipped composition. the truncated "STOP" seems so appropriate. well done.</td>', 'gorgeous light, beautiful clipped composition. the truncated "STOP" seems so appropriate. well done.', '2015-02-20 20:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319043, 1140964, 32011, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful example of the art of tone and colour.  Addition/inclusion of the human element adds an emotion, a warmth.  Well done.</td>', 'This is a beautiful example of the art of tone and colour.  Addition/inclusion of the human element adds an emotion, a warmth.  Well done.', '2015-02-20 20:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319044, 1141148, 50695, '<td valign="top">sensual active alive</td>', 'sensual active alive', '2015-02-20 20:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319046, 1142019, 50695, '<td valign="top">great endless texture</td>', 'great endless texture', '2015-02-20 20:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319048, 1141882, 50695, '<td valign="top">somehow this photo turns the establishment''s name into a joke. This is like a postmodern Norman Rockwell.</td>', 'somehow this photo turns the establishment''s name into a joke. This is like a postmodern Norman Rockwell.', '2015-02-20 21:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319049, 1141094, 50695, '<td valign="top">the teeth of imagination</td>', 'the teeth of imagination', '2015-02-20 21:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319050, 1141807, 50695, '<td valign="top">one can''t help but think of the lifesaver metaphorically. the blur seems to be encouraging us to do so.</td>', 'one can''t help but think of the lifesaver metaphorically. the blur seems to be encouraging us to do so.', '2015-02-20 21:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319051, 1141581, 35804, '<td valign="top">boop sez, dont trust a guy that wears all The North Faceespecially matchy match The North Face.</td>', 'boop sez, dont trust a guy that wears all The North Faceespecially matchy match The North Face.', '2015-02-20 21:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319052, 1141082, 63218, '<td valign="top">This is endlessly fascinating to look at. Not the first cityscape I''ve ever seen, but easily the most remarkable--for the light, the strange colors, the sharp focus that doesn''t call attention to itself, the flying point of view.  For me, part of the fascination is wondering which city this is. I''m guessing Dubai, so I''m wondering if that odd color in the light is normal for that city. Anyway...awesome! I can see why you entered it in this challenge.</td>', 'This is endlessly fascinating to look at. Not the first cityscape I''ve ever seen, but easily the most remarkable--for the light, the strange colors, the sharp focus that doesn''t call attention to itself, the flying point of view.  For me, part of the fascination is wondering which city this is. I''m guessing Dubai, so I''m wondering if that odd color in the light is normal for that city. Anyway...awesome! I can see why you entered it in this challenge.', '2015-02-20 21:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319053, 1141732, 50695, '<td valign="top">A great photo gives us parallels. The out-of-place heron parallels the poses of the phonelookers, I think its the awkward armlessness of it and mirrors the beaks of the beach chairs and of course those blurry shapes in the distance, an abstracter simulacrum.</td>', 'A great photo gives us parallels. The out-of-place heron parallels the poses of the phonelookers, I think its the awkward armlessness of it and mirrors the beaks of the beach chairs and of course those blurry shapes in the distance, an abstracter simulacrum.', '2015-02-20 21:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319054, 1141102, 50695, '<td valign="top">the detail that takes this over the top is the strange angle at which we see the dog, so that it is transformed into something else, perhaps another piece of furniture from another universe.</td>', 'the detail that takes this over the top is the strange angle at which we see the dog, so that it is transformed into something else, perhaps another piece of furniture from another universe.', '2015-02-20 21:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319055, 1141023, 50695, '<td valign="top">an angle I''ve never seen before, on a swan. thank you</td>', 'an angle I''ve never seen before, on a swan. thank you', '2015-02-20 21:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319056, 1141513, 50695, '<td valign="top">my first reaction was the processing was overdone, but then I saw the hat, and I thought, yes, you processed this perfectly.</td>', 'my first reaction was the processing was overdone, but then I saw the hat, and I thought, yes, you processed this perfectly.', '2015-02-20 21:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319057, 1142095, 50695, '<td valign="top">glorious use of reflection. is that a painting or real greenery?</td>', 'glorious use of reflection. is that a painting or real greenery?', '2015-02-20 21:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319059, 1141110, 76335, '<td valign="top">Colors are unrealistic. Still has a nice graphic quality to it.</td>', 'Colors are unrealistic. Still has a nice graphic quality to it.', '2015-02-20 21:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319060, 1141480, 76335, '<td valign="top">Playful.</td>', 'Playful.', '2015-02-20 21:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319061, 1142044, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like the softness.</td>', 'I like the softness.', '2015-02-20 21:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319063, 1141960, 76335, '<td valign="top">Very playful composition. Suggestive and humorous. Good.</td>', 'Very playful composition. Suggestive and humorous. Good.', '2015-02-20 21:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319065, 1141095, 76335, '<td valign="top">Suggestive and dark. Lots lurking in the shadows. The title offers no help, which I like. An eight for you.</td>', 'Suggestive and dark. Lots lurking in the shadows. The title offers no help, which I like. An eight for you.', '2015-02-20 21:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319066, 1141399, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice complementary colors.</td>', 'Nice complementary colors.', '2015-02-20 21:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319067, 1141879, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautifully seen.</td>', 'Beautifully seen.', '2015-02-20 21:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319068, 1141813, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like this, want to like it more. Not sure what the splashy business is...</td>', 'I like this, want to like it more. Not sure what the splashy business is...', '2015-02-20 21:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319069, 1142081, 76335, '<td valign="top">Funny -- maybe a bit forced.</td>', 'Funny -- maybe a bit forced.', '2015-02-20 21:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319070, 1141931, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like what''s happening frame left. I feel like I need a face or something frame right to add balance, irony, or something. The two shadowy crosswalkers don''t quite do it.</td>', 'I like what''s happening frame left. I feel like I need a face or something frame right to add balance, irony, or something. The two shadowy crosswalkers don''t quite do it.', '2015-02-20 21:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319073, 1141385, 76335, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept. The cat''s a bit <i>too</i> blown out.</td>', 'Interesting concept. The cat''s a bit too blown out.', '2015-02-20 21:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319074, 1142063, 138630, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colors and smoothness - I love the way everything merges - the sand, the water, the sky, the tones.</td>', 'Gorgeous colors and smoothness - I love the way everything merges - the sand, the water, the sky, the tones.', '2015-02-20 22:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319075, 1140964, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great image. Soothing, waves of blue after blue, depth and a great complimentary contrasting sky. A story. Very well framed as well. Nicely done.</td>', 'Great image. Soothing, waves of blue after blue, depth and a great complimentary contrasting sky. A story. Very well framed as well. Nicely done.', '2015-02-20 22:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319078, 1141105, 63218, '<td valign="top">I like this plain and simple presentation.</td>', 'I like this plain and simple presentation.', '2015-02-20 22:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319080, 1141438, 108069, '<td valign="top">Love the way this is framed. Wonderful silvers. Great entry.</td>', 'Love the way this is framed. Wonderful silvers. Great entry.', '2015-02-20 22:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319083, 1141944, 100831, '<td valign="top">I could stare at this for hours. Bumpity bump.</td>', 'I could stare at this for hours. Bumpity bump.', '2015-02-20 23:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319084, 1141931, 100831, '<td valign="top">Great street stuff.... lots of waiting... and wondering.</td>', 'Great street stuff.... lots of waiting... and wondering.', '2015-02-20 23:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319088, 1141404, 100831, '<td valign="top">A postcard image... but a very interesting one. I like it.</td>', 'A postcard image... but a very interesting one. I like it.', '2015-02-21 00:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319089, 1141104, 94815, '<td valign="top">Very sensitively composed.</td>', 'Very sensitively composed.', '2015-02-21 00:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319090, 1141944, 30490, '<td valign="top">hmmm  googled the word murmuration, a flock of starlings.  Not sure if this IS a flock of starlings or if it is something representing a flock.  Could be textured granite too.... I think if there was some point of reference in this image it would be stronger in my opinion.  Something that gave a clue to the scale would help me understand the image better.</td>', 'hmmm  googled the word murmuration, a flock of starlings.  Not sure if this IS a flock of starlings or if it is something representing a flock.  Could be textured granite too.... I think if there was some point of reference in this image it would be stronger in my opinion.  Something that gave a clue to the scale would help me understand the image better.', '2015-02-21 00:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319091, 1141561, 30490, '<td valign="top">Nose prints or ice crystals on the glass?  Interesting capture, made me think a little....</td>', 'Nose prints or ice crystals on the glass?  Interesting capture, made me think a little....', '2015-02-21 00:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319092, 1141960, 30490, '<td valign="top">Looking for Alice in Wonderland? Interesting image, kind of fun too.</td>', 'Looking for Alice in Wonderland? Interesting image, kind of fun too.', '2015-02-21 00:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319093, 1141735, 30490, '<td valign="top">This one just makes me cringe...not the photo, but the subject!  A very lifelike image and the eye just draws you into the center of the image.... So happy I''m only seeing this one though my computer screen!</td>', 'This one just makes me cringe...not the photo, but the subject!  A very lifelike image and the eye just draws you into the center of the image.... So happy I''m only seeing this one though my computer screen!', '2015-02-21 01:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319094, 1141839, 63218, '<td valign="top">That''s some nice, clear sunshine light there--the painting shows a figure in night-time darkness &amp; it''s an interesting contrast. My eye goes right to the waterfall.</td>', 'That''s some nice, clear sunshine light there--the painting shows a figure in night-time darkness & it''s an interesting contrast. My eye goes right to the waterfall.', '2015-02-21 01:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319097, 1142081, 61396, '<td valign="top">too much booze I guess</td>', 'too much booze I guess', '2015-02-21 04:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319099, 1141131, 61396, '<td valign="top">and indeed, discerning the foreground from the background is a non trivial task</td>', 'and indeed, discerning the foreground from the background is a non trivial task', '2015-02-21 04:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319100, 1141110, 61396, '<td valign="top">the disturbing phosphorus green is bound to make an impact on any viewer (maybe less on the color blind). I like the wide format.</td>', 'the disturbing phosphorus green is bound to make an impact on any viewer (maybe less on the color blind). I like the wide format.', '2015-02-21 04:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319103, 1141861, 61396, '<td valign="top">I like that he paints his own background. Nicely composed.</td>', 'I like that he paints his own background. Nicely composed.', '2015-02-21 04:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319104, 1141321, 61396, '<td valign="top">a slice of vastness</td>', 'a slice of vastness', '2015-02-21 04:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319105, 1142058, 61396, '<td valign="top">you put water colors to a good use</td>', 'you put water colors to a good use', '2015-02-21 04:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319106, 1141731, 61396, '<td valign="top">this is hot!</td>', 'this is hot!', '2015-02-21 04:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319107, 1142097, 61396, '<td valign="top">dynamic style you two got</td>', 'dynamic style you two got', '2015-02-21 04:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
