(7319117, 1141799, 137576, '<td valign="top">selective desaturation!!, I''m guessing a relative new photographer or editor it happens to us all and I''ve been guilty of it in the past. and it doesn''t go down well on dpc. it can work incredible well, see what speilberg and Janusz Kami&amp;#324;ski did with the girl in the red coat in shindler''s list etc, but the missed focus on the stamen then the rash of colour isn''t helping sell this to me.</td>', 'selective desaturation!!, I''m guessing a relative new photographer or editor it happens to us all and I''ve been guilty of it in the past. and it doesn''t go down well on dpc. it can work incredible well, see what speilberg and Janusz Kami&#324;ski did with the girl in the red coat in shindler''s list etc, but the missed focus on the stamen then the rash of colour isn''t helping sell this to me.', '2015-02-21 05:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
