(7319192, 1142081, 100831, '<td valign="top">oh you silly wabbit:) I''m enjoying this one.</td>', 'oh you silly wabbit:) I''m enjoying this one.', '2015-02-21 11:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319193, 1141983, 100831, '<td valign="top">I get the idea but I think it''s a bit overdone, overall. Also the horizon needs to be straightened so that the people won''t fall out of the boat! I hope you don''t mind my honesty here.</td>', 'I get the idea but I think it''s a bit overdone, overall. Also the horizon needs to be straightened so that the people won''t fall out of the boat! I hope you don''t mind my honesty here.', '2015-02-21 11:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319195, 1141119, 100831, '<td valign="top">This one actually gets way more interesting the more I look at it... probably not an easy capture either. Colors are spooky and it has almost a 3D look to it (not flat after all!).</td>', 'This one actually gets way more interesting the more I look at it... probably not an easy capture either. Colors are spooky and it has almost a 3D look to it (not flat after all!).', '2015-02-21 11:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319202, 1142083, 81362, '<td valign="top">Processing to imitate paintings does not create art, but this image has drama in the dynamics of waves, light, rocks, and sky. That brings it into the world of art in the tradition of landscapes that have something extra to make us think. Evoking feelings of turmoil while still making room for appreciation of natural beauty makes an interesting combination.</td>', 'Processing to imitate paintings does not create art, but this image has drama in the dynamics of waves, light, rocks, and sky. That brings it into the world of art in the tradition of landscapes that have something extra to make us think. Evoking feelings of turmoil while still making room for appreciation of natural beauty makes an interesting combination.', '2015-02-21 11:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319203, 1140964, 81362, '<td valign="top">I am enjoying the shades of blue and rhythm of shapes in an image that evokes calm feelings. The foreground, initially seeming to be a dull candidate for cropping, plays on second look an interesting role with a subtle texture-like pattern involving darker and lighter blue that provides an intersting balance to the larger scale shapes.</td>', 'I am enjoying the shades of blue and rhythm of shapes in an image that evokes calm feelings. The foreground, initially seeming to be a dull candidate for cropping, plays on second look an interesting role with a subtle texture-like pattern involving darker and lighter blue that provides an intersting balance to the larger scale shapes.', '2015-02-21 12:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319204, 1142058, 81362, '<td valign="top">Well-seen and well-captured bit of nature''s doodling. This natural find that plays with ideas of abstract art works well in this challenge. I like the regular pattern of detail in the rope making a contrast with the free form reflections.</td>', 'Well-seen and well-captured bit of nature''s doodling. This natural find that plays with ideas of abstract art works well in this challenge. I like the regular pattern of detail in the rope making a contrast with the free form reflections.', '2015-02-21 12:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319206, 1141282, 81362, '<td valign="top">Very good handling of high contrast while preserving detail. Reminds me of the feeling I get contemplating of works by Ansel Adams.</td>', 'Very good handling of high contrast while preserving detail. Reminds me of the feeling I get contemplating of works by Ansel Adams.', '2015-02-21 12:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319207, 1141561, 81362, '<td valign="top">I would have guessed you captured reflections on a frozen pond until I saw the title. Interesting and artful composition of shapes and interesting play of colors.</td>', 'I would have guessed you captured reflections on a frozen pond until I saw the title. Interesting and artful composition of shapes and interesting play of colors.', '2015-02-21 12:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319209, 1141893, 81362, '<td valign="top">The circular part of the framing, whether knot hole, hole in a metal fence, or added in post, generates some thinking, although the bench and settings seem rather dull. The dark corners detract from the image. All in all, I think I might have scored this high if the image were presented as ending at the outer edge of the circular elements (with remaining pixels processed as transparent) to make this an artistic statement about lack of need for photographs to be rectilinear depictions.</td>', 'The circular part of the framing, whether knot hole, hole in a metal fence, or added in post, generates some thinking, although the bench and settings seem rather dull. The dark corners detract from the image. All in all, I think I might have scored this high if the image were presented as ending at the outer edge of the circular elements (with remaining pixels processed as transparent) to make this an artistic statement about lack of need for photographs to be rectilinear depictions.', '2015-02-21 12:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319210, 1141556, 81362, '<td valign="top">The squares of various colors are interesting, but the overall blurry effect feels artificial and imposed upon the image. Will be interested in reading any notes you share.</td>', 'The squares of various colors are interesting, but the overall blurry effect feels artificial and imposed upon the image. Will be interested in reading any notes you share.', '2015-02-21 12:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319216, 1142063, 83313, '<td valign="top">I am divided on how to vote on entries like this. Dramatic, technically perfect landscapes like this tend to score very highly, and I feel I must give an appropriately high vote to reward the skill it took to capture them. They don''t get my highest vote, however. Those are reserved for the images that make me stop to examine them more closely or that pull an emotion or memory from me. This gets a 7.</td>', 'I am divided on how to vote on entries like this. Dramatic, technically perfect landscapes like this tend to score very highly, and I feel I must give an appropriately high vote to reward the skill it took to capture them. They don''t get my highest vote, however. Those are reserved for the images that make me stop to examine them more closely or that pull an emotion or memory from me. This gets a 7.', '2015-02-21 12:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319217, 1141944, 83313, '<td valign="top">That''s cool looking!</td>', 'That''s cool looking!', '2015-02-21 12:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319218, 1141581, 83313, '<td valign="top">Interesting street photography. There is some unstated story that my brain is trying to fill in. Not sure this fits my personal definition of art, but that will vary person to person.</td>', 'Interesting street photography. There is some unstated story that my brain is trying to fill in. Not sure this fits my personal definition of art, but that will vary person to person.', '2015-02-21 12:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319220, 1141368, 61396, '<td valign="top">absorbing. I am stuck on this for several minutes now.</td>', 'absorbing. I am stuck on this for several minutes now.', '2015-02-21 12:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319221, 1141553, 61396, '<td valign="top">well composed with delicious colors.</td>', 'well composed with delicious colors.', '2015-02-21 12:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319222, 1141931, 83313, '<td valign="top">Haven''t seen a pram like that in a long time. I think my mom pushed me in a similar one 54 years ago. There are bits of the construction that tells me it is recently made, however.</td>', 'Haven''t seen a pram like that in a long time. I think my mom pushed me in a similar one 54 years ago. There are bits of the construction that tells me it is recently made, however.', '2015-02-21 12:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319224, 1141876, 83313, '<td valign="top">A bit overprocessed for my preferences and some haloing is visible around the bridge (hard to avoid haloing with such a perfectly smooth shade in the sky). I think I would love a more sedate version of this. As it is, I can only give it a 5. Sorry.</td>', 'A bit overprocessed for my preferences and some haloing is visible around the bridge (hard to avoid haloing with such a perfectly smooth shade in the sky). I think I would love a more sedate version of this. As it is, I can only give it a 5. Sorry.', '2015-02-21 12:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319225, 1141399, 81362, '<td valign="top">Strong design elements artistically combined: color contrast between gold tones and blue combine with strong dark shapes of pier supports and dark horizontals of water ripples. Could consider cropping away the upper part of the distant pier where the white light and paler cyan tones dilute the impact of the main part of the image.</td>', 'Strong design elements artistically combined: color contrast between gold tones and blue combine with strong dark shapes of pier supports and dark horizontals of water ripples. Could consider cropping away the upper part of the distant pier where the white light and paler cyan tones dilute the impact of the main part of the image.', '2015-02-21 12:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319226, 1142084, 83313, '<td valign="top">For some reason, I find cows to be fascinating. Don''t know why. Horses are much friendlier and are like oversized people-loving dogs. But horses just don''t have the same appeal.</td>', 'For some reason, I find cows to be fascinating. Don''t know why. Horses are much friendlier and are like oversized people-loving dogs. But horses just don''t have the same appeal.', '2015-02-21 12:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319227, 1141983, 81362, '<td valign="top">To my eye, the jarring extreme departure from what appears to have started out as a realistic landscape yanks my attention from the image to the technique itself. Feels like being shouted at, or maybe like running across a band playing with amplifiers cranked past the pain point. Instead of contemplating the image for possible artistic merit, I end up feeling distracted by the technical aspect and feel vaguely annoyed without it being a genuine emotional involvement with negative but powerful work of art.</td>', 'To my eye, the jarring extreme departure from what appears to have started out as a realistic landscape yanks my attention from the image to the technique itself. Feels like being shouted at, or maybe like running across a band playing with amplifiers cranked past the pain point. Instead of contemplating the image for possible artistic merit, I end up feeling distracted by the technical aspect and feel vaguely annoyed without it being a genuine emotional involvement with negative but powerful work of art.', '2015-02-21 12:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
