(7319249, 1140962, 63218, '<td valign="top">I so admire this. Helplessly admire the genius in this. A little moment taken out of context &amp; it stays there, creating its own context, its own story free of time. There is an economy of expression that is quite poetic. Best in show for me. Thank you.</td>', 'I so admire this. Helplessly admire the genius in this. A little moment taken out of context & it stays there, creating its own context, its own story free of time. There is an economy of expression that is quite poetic. Best in show for me. Thank you.', '2015-02-21 13:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
