(7319257, 1141104, 61396, '<td valign="top">She elevates the Rothko considerably with the shapes and colors you composed into the scene (and I like how she is holding the exhibition guide on the right page behind her back).</td>', 'She elevates the Rothko considerably with the shapes and colors you composed into the scene (and I like how she is holding the exhibition guide on the right page behind her back).', '2015-02-21 13:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319259, 1141802, 61396, '<td valign="top">a well played Clive classic</td>', 'a well played Clive classic', '2015-02-21 13:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319260, 1141931, 61396, '<td valign="top">Two of the subjects of this photograph are not shown: obviously the baby who is under cover, but also the photographer, who enjoys the cover (from unsuspecting audience) provided by a wide angle lens.</td>', 'Two of the subjects of this photograph are not shown: obviously the baby who is under cover, but also the photographer, who enjoys the cover (from unsuspecting audience) provided by a wide angle lens.', '2015-02-21 13:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319261, 1141791, 63218, '<td valign="top">A classic. Well done.</td>', 'A classic. Well done.', '2015-02-21 13:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319262, 1142019, 81362, '<td valign="top">Better than many raindrop on water images, I think because the black/white conversion was handled in a way that helps us appreciate the resulting texture along with the shapes. On revisiting the image, I now also see a somewhat heart shaped figure of face - just right of center where the thicker dark branch leads my gaze - with two round raindrop ripple eyes, a narrow light-toned nose, light colored triangular chin. Maybe another similar face with more opened mouth a bit higher up the image. Now I can''t un-see them. Lends an extra layer of interest to the image.</td>', 'Better than many raindrop on water images, I think because the black/white conversion was handled in a way that helps us appreciate the resulting texture along with the shapes. On revisiting the image, I now also see a somewhat heart shaped figure of face - just right of center where the thicker dark branch leads my gaze - with two round raindrop ripple eyes, a narrow light-toned nose, light colored triangular chin. Maybe another similar face with more opened mouth a bit higher up the image. Now I can''t un-see them. Lends an extra layer of interest to the image.', '2015-02-21 13:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319268, 1141616, 11769, '<td valign="top">wonderful photograph, you''ve made my day, this endless snow we''ve been getting. thank you.</td>', 'wonderful photograph, you''ve made my day, this endless snow we''ve been getting. thank you.', '2015-02-21 13:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
