(7319284, 1141321, 138630, '<td valign="top">I was here last spring - a magical place, isn''t it?  I always struggle with the blues and purples in the distance - how much is enough, how much is too much.  This is a little purple for me but undeniably lovely in its flow.</td>', 'I was here last spring - a magical place, isn''t it?  I always struggle with the blues and purples in the distance - how much is enough, how much is too much.  This is a little purple for me but undeniably lovely in its flow.', '2015-02-21 14:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
