(7319381, 1141094, 156466, '<td valign="top">I hope folks gave this some time for their eyes to adjust from the previous image.  Very high key but worth the wait.  Very nice.</td>', 'I hope folks gave this some time for their eyes to adjust from the previous image.  Very high key but worth the wait.  Very nice.', '2015-02-21 16:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319382, 1141849, 156466, '<td valign="top">I love this, with the possible exception of the texture that looks a bit like a cow growing from the tree top.</td>', 'I love this, with the possible exception of the texture that looks a bit like a cow growing from the tree top.', '2015-02-21 16:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319384, 1142009, 156466, '<td valign="top">Love it</td>', 'Love it', '2015-02-21 16:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319385, 1141206, 156466, '<td valign="top">Absolutely wonderful</td>', 'Absolutely wonderful', '2015-02-21 16:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319386, 1141600, 156466, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of most blurred stuff.  This is an exception.  Very nice.</td>', 'I''m not a fan of most blurred stuff.  This is an exception.  Very nice.', '2015-02-21 16:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319387, 1141282, 156466, '<td valign="top">I really liked it until I saw the people.  Then I loved it.  Top so far.</td>', 'I really liked it until I saw the people.  Then I loved it.  Top so far.', '2015-02-21 16:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319388, 1141942, 156466, '<td valign="top">Given that it''s on a table I feel like I would have liked to have seen a bit more of it.</td>', 'Given that it''s on a table I feel like I would have liked to have seen a bit more of it.', '2015-02-21 16:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319389, 1141894, 156466, '<td valign="top">The letter-boxing doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'The letter-boxing doesn''t work for me.', '2015-02-21 16:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319391, 1141802, 156466, '<td valign="top">You can sense her joy.  Wonderful capture.</td>', 'You can sense her joy.  Wonderful capture.', '2015-02-21 16:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319392, 1141272, 156466, '<td valign="top">Would love to see this reprocessed with the same color levels but a lot less structuring.</td>', 'Would love to see this reprocessed with the same color levels but a lot less structuring.', '2015-02-21 16:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319393, 1141023, 156466, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit like a fish on a wall. LOL  Love it.</td>', 'Looks a bit like a fish on a wall. LOL  Love it.', '2015-02-21 16:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319395, 1141104, 156466, '<td valign="top">Funny, but I had no idea who Rothko was until Craig Ferguson ranted about how much he didn''t like him on a show last year.  Made me look up who he was, and I recognized the painting before I ever saw the title.  Made me smile - and feel much smarter than I should give myself credit for.  LOL  Love the shot.</td>', 'Funny, but I had no idea who Rothko was until Craig Ferguson ranted about how much he didn''t like him on a show last year.  Made me look up who he was, and I recognized the painting before I ever saw the title.  Made me smile - and feel much smarter than I should give myself credit for.  LOL  Love the shot.', '2015-02-21 16:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319396, 1142037, 104230, '<td valign="top">Intriguing.  Holds my attention. I like it and keep coming back to it. I find myself speculating on what time of year this was taken.  Are these long summer evening shadows or low light winter shadows? I imagine this man in an overcoat, but who knows! In my top 10.</td>', 'Intriguing.  Holds my attention. I like it and keep coming back to it. I find myself speculating on what time of year this was taken.  Are these long summer evening shadows or low light winter shadows? I imagine this man in an overcoat, but who knows! In my top 10.', '2015-02-21 16:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319397, 1141110, 156466, '<td valign="top">A little too...</td>', 'A little too...', '2015-02-21 16:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319399, 1141131, 156466, '<td valign="top">Has me looking for Escher in there.</td>', 'Has me looking for Escher in there.', '2015-02-21 16:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319401, 1141879, 156466, '<td valign="top">I really like it, but I find myself distracted by the road edge.</td>', 'I really like it, but I find myself distracted by the road edge.', '2015-02-21 16:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319402, 1141886, 156466, '<td valign="top">I want it to roll - like a pinball.</td>', 'I want it to roll - like a pinball.', '2015-02-21 16:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319404, 1141395, 156466, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture of a moment</td>', 'Wonderful capture of a moment', '2015-02-21 16:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319407, 1142035, 156466, '<td valign="top">Normally I''d want to put him on the left side facing in, but I love the idea that I don''t know what''s just past the edge.  Love it.</td>', 'Normally I''d want to put him on the left side facing in, but I love the idea that I don''t know what''s just past the edge.  Love it.', '2015-02-21 16:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319408, 1141800, 156466, '<td valign="top">Wasn''t sure about it until I read the title.  8</td>', 'Wasn''t sure about it until I read the title.  8', '2015-02-21 16:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319410, 1141561, 97225, '<td valign="top">Lovely, artistic mix of elements.</td>', 'Lovely, artistic mix of elements.', '2015-02-21 16:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319411, 1141371, 97225, '<td valign="top">Awesome sky, bird is a great bonus.</td>', 'Awesome sky, bird is a great bonus.', '2015-02-21 16:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319416, 1141889, 97225, '<td valign="top">I love the impressionistic blur, but the tilted horizon spoils the picture somewhat. I can see that if you simply straightened it while cropping you''d lose parts you wouldn''t want to. I''d suggest edit&gt;transform&gt;skew if you use photoshop.</td>', 'I love the impressionistic blur, but the tilted horizon spoils the picture somewhat. I can see that if you simply straightened it while cropping you''d lose parts you wouldn''t want to. I''d suggest edit>transform>skew if you use photoshop.', '2015-02-21 16:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319417, 1141941, 97225, '<td valign="top">Pardon the pun but this works on so many levels. Very interesting, and pleasing to my eye.</td>', 'Pardon the pun but this works on so many levels. Very interesting, and pleasing to my eye.', '2015-02-21 16:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319418, 1141791, 97225, '<td valign="top">Wonderful geometry beautifully captured and processed. (Not sure I see any malevolence.)</td>', 'Wonderful geometry beautifully captured and processed. (Not sure I see any malevolence.)', '2015-02-21 16:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319419, 1141941, 32011, '<td valign="top">Beautiful underlying symmetry with the architecture, but the lighting, and the people add a dynamic dimension that takes this from "meh" to "wow".</td>', 'Beautiful underlying symmetry with the architecture, but the lighting, and the people add a dynamic dimension that takes this from "meh" to "wow".', '2015-02-21 17:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319420, 1141980, 97225, '<td valign="top">Like a watercolour painting done on silk, I love the way those vibrant colours bleed.</td>', 'Like a watercolour painting done on silk, I love the way those vibrant colours bleed.', '2015-02-21 17:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319421, 1141206, 97225, '<td valign="top">Love the geometry, the textures and the colours.</td>', 'Love the geometry, the textures and the colours.', '2015-02-21 17:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319422, 1142063, 32011, '<td valign="top">One of the more traditional, DPC voter friendly landscapes in the challenge, but the art isn''t missing, by any stretch of the imagination.  Wonderful composition gives this balance... the detail in the sand is balanced by the blurred clouds... beautiful purples and blues dominate, but the hint of pink and red adds warmth.</td>', 'One of the more traditional, DPC voter friendly landscapes in the challenge, but the art isn''t missing, by any stretch of the imagination.  Wonderful composition gives this balance... the detail in the sand is balanced by the blurred clouds... beautiful purples and blues dominate, but the hint of pink and red adds warmth.', '2015-02-21 17:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319423, 1141798, 97225, '<td valign="top">What an unexpected subject, and surprisingly pleasing image!</td>', 'What an unexpected subject, and surprisingly pleasing image!', '2015-02-21 17:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319424, 1140972, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! I love the trees and love the lights and shadows on the snow.</td>', 'Beautiful! I love the trees and love the lights and shadows on the snow.', '2015-02-21 17:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319425, 1141104, 32011, '<td valign="top">How very recursive... I''m looking at art depicting someone looking at art.  Makes me wonder what they''re thinking, and if they''d wonder the same if they saw a photo of me looking at this.  Nice composition... the man on the left, also with his hands behind his back, must be looking at something equally fascinating, but we''re left to contemplate what it is that has captured his attention.</td>', 'How very recursive... I''m looking at art depicting someone looking at art.  Makes me wonder what they''re thinking, and if they''d wonder the same if they saw a photo of me looking at this.  Nice composition... the man on the left, also with his hands behind his back, must be looking at something equally fascinating, but we''re left to contemplate what it is that has captured his attention.', '2015-02-21 17:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319426, 1142018, 97225, '<td valign="top">Nice one - I like the tones and the composition.</td>', 'Nice one - I like the tones and the composition.', '2015-02-21 17:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319427, 1141513, 97225, '<td valign="top">Oh, the horse is catching the hat with its tail! Love the image and the processing. It sort of looks like it could have come out of a very old newspaper.</td>', 'Oh, the horse is catching the hat with its tail! Love the image and the processing. It sort of looks like it could have come out of a very old newspaper.', '2015-02-21 17:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319429, 1141600, 32011, '<td valign="top">It''s Ansel Adams with a difference.  It''s wonderful.  Reminds me of an Australian summer, where bushfires ravage large swathes of land.  You''ve triggered emotion and memory with this wonderful image, which alone makes it art, but you''ve done with with an aesthetically pleasing image that would look beautiful on a gallery or home wall.</td>', 'It''s Ansel Adams with a difference.  It''s wonderful.  Reminds me of an Australian summer, where bushfires ravage large swathes of land.  You''ve triggered emotion and memory with this wonderful image, which alone makes it art, but you''ve done with with an aesthetically pleasing image that would look beautiful on a gallery or home wall.', '2015-02-21 17:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319430, 1141385, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed, pleasing tones and grain - and quirky elements that make me pause and wonder, and appreciate. A lovely piece of art!</td>', 'Beautifully composed, pleasing tones and grain - and quirky elements that make me pause and wonder, and appreciate. A lovely piece of art!', '2015-02-21 17:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319431, 1141959, 32011, '<td valign="top">You''ve managed to make an unappealing subject into a beautiful piece of art, with your processing and composition.  One wonders why the man is lying on the wall... what was he thinking when he bought those speedos.</td>', 'You''ve managed to make an unappealing subject into a beautiful piece of art, with your processing and composition.  One wonders why the man is lying on the wall... what was he thinking when he bought those speedos.', '2015-02-21 17:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319432, 1141611, 32011, '<td valign="top">One of the more traditional type landscape images in the challenge, but it''s the little elements that take this from an outstandingly beautiful "landscape" to being an excellent work of art.  The lighting is wonderful, as is the detail and composition.  I love the people within the image... they add an emotional anchor for the viewer, and makes one wonder about their story, and their connection, if there is or isn''t one.  Add to all this, the art on the building, and it''s connection to one of the people... the intrigue and questions further build... is that Clive?  Is he the artist?  Excellent work of art.  Thank you for sharing this with the world.</td>', 'One of the more traditional type landscape images in the challenge, but it''s the little elements that take this from an outstandingly beautiful "landscape" to being an excellent work of art.  The lighting is wonderful, as is the detail and composition.  I love the people within the image... they add an emotional anchor for the viewer, and makes one wonder about their story, and their connection, if there is or isn''t one.  Add to all this, the art on the building, and it''s connection to one of the people... the intrigue and questions further build... is that Clive?  Is he the artist?  Excellent work of art.  Thank you for sharing this with the world.', '2015-02-21 17:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319434, 1142019, 97225, '<td valign="top">Art by nature, art by photographer. Beautiful!</td>', 'Art by nature, art by photographer. Beautiful!', '2015-02-21 17:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319435, 1141784, 100831, '<td valign="top">love the abstractness on this one.</td>', 'love the abstractness on this one.', '2015-02-21 17:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319436, 1142019, 32011, '<td valign="top">Drip... drip... drip... this moment in time capture, and frozen, still has the dynamics that were there, then.  The waves radiating from each drop, the waves interacting with eachother... superimposing.  The light reflecting and refracting... the shadows and highlights... it''s a physics experiment being done by nature and you''ve captured it so well.</td>', 'Drip... drip... drip... this moment in time capture, and frozen, still has the dynamics that were there, then.  The waves radiating from each drop, the waves interacting with eachother... superimposing.  The light reflecting and refracting... the shadows and highlights... it''s a physics experiment being done by nature and you''ve captured it so well.', '2015-02-21 17:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319437, 1141716, 118154, '<td valign="top">8</td>', '8', '2015-02-21 17:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319439, 1142001, 118154, '<td valign="top">One of my uppermost picks.9</td>', 'One of my uppermost picks.9', '2015-02-21 17:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319440, 1140995, 100831, '<td valign="top">pointillism... nicely done. well composed, pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'pointillism... nicely done. well composed, pleasing to the eye.', '2015-02-21 17:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319441, 1141784, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, fluid, silky abstract. The satin is flowing away, dissolving, dispersing, transforming itself into a watercolour.</td>', 'Beautiful, fluid, silky abstract. The satin is flowing away, dissolving, dispersing, transforming itself into a watercolour.', '2015-02-21 17:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319442, 1141942, 97225, '<td valign="top">Fabulous form.</td>', 'Fabulous form.', '2015-02-21 17:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319443, 1141932, 32011, '<td valign="top">A magical, mystical world awaits as you walk through the portal.  Wonderful composition and processing.</td>', 'A magical, mystical world awaits as you walk through the portal.  Wonderful composition and processing.', '2015-02-21 17:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319446, 1141104, 100831, '<td valign="top">ha! great seeing. And deserves comtemplation! In my top ten.</td>', 'ha! great seeing. And deserves comtemplation! In my top ten.', '2015-02-21 17:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319448, 1141282, 32011, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully processed image... the people providing scale and emotional link to the otherwise alien, surreal image.</td>', 'Wonderfully processed image... the people providing scale and emotional link to the otherwise alien, surreal image.', '2015-02-21 17:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319449, 1142019, 100831, '<td valign="top">I like the patterns and reflection... creates a moody abstract.</td>', 'I like the patterns and reflection... creates a moody abstract.', '2015-02-21 17:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319450, 1141802, 32011, '<td valign="top">A work of art that captures the joy of a child.  Nothing else existing in the world for this girl as she runs through the long grass and flowers, and nothing else exists for those of us looking at this image.  You''ve warmed my heart with this... thank you.</td>', 'A work of art that captures the joy of a child.  Nothing else existing in the world for this girl as she runs through the long grass and flowers, and nothing else exists for those of us looking at this image.  You''ve warmed my heart with this... thank you.', '2015-02-21 17:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319451, 1141552, 97225, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. The leading lines draw my eye almost out of the pictures but then the clouds catch me and clouds draw me back to the sun. Beautiful pastel colours.</td>', 'Interesting composition. The leading lines draw my eye almost out of the pictures but then the clouds catch me and clouds draw me back to the sun. Beautiful pastel colours.', '2015-02-21 17:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319452, 1141264, 97225, '<td valign="top">Charm and elegance.</td>', 'Charm and elegance.', '2015-02-21 17:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319453, 1141849, 97225, '<td valign="top">Simple and lovely.</td>', 'Simple and lovely.', '2015-02-21 17:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319454, 1141671, 100831, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy how the animal fits into the image. The blurs of the feet and tail are perfect! Nice golden shades compliment well,<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2015-02-22 00:05:09.</i></td>', 'I really enjoy how the animal fits into the image. The blurs of the feet and tail are perfect! Nice golden shades compliment well,', '2015-02-21 17:29:33.000000', '2015-02-22 00:05:09.000000', 1),
(7319455, 1141985, 97225, '<td valign="top">Interesting portrait.</td>', 'Interesting portrait.', '2015-02-21 17:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319456, 1141882, 32011, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful, cultural, piece of art.  So much information, telling a wonderful story or summer in the country.  Mother checks out the options, as the boys lose patience and just want some sweet relief from the heat.  In the backgroud, the recliner where the shop attendant, one assumes it''s "Bubba", goes to relax between the questions and requests for service from the customers.  Wonderful detail and composition.</td>', 'This is a wonderful, cultural, piece of art.  So much information, telling a wonderful story or summer in the country.  Mother checks out the options, as the boys lose patience and just want some sweet relief from the heat.  In the backgroud, the recliner where the shop attendant, one assumes it''s "Bubba", goes to relax between the questions and requests for service from the customers.  Wonderful detail and composition.', '2015-02-21 17:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319458, 1142090, 97225, '<td valign="top">I liked this on the first pass, more so when I come back. Bumping up.</td>', 'I liked this on the first pass, more so when I come back. Bumping up.', '2015-02-21 17:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319459, 1141751, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and colour.</td>', 'Beautiful light and colour.', '2015-02-21 17:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319460, 1141771, 32011, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  I''d describe this as desktop art... a beautiful, minimalist image that could grace the screens of millions of computers around the world.  I love the detail in the bird.</td>', 'This is beautiful.  I''d describe this as desktop art... a beautiful, minimalist image that could grace the screens of millions of computers around the world.  I love the detail in the bird.', '2015-02-21 17:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319461, 1141137, 97225, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, beautifully photographed and processed.</td>', 'Interesting subject, beautifully photographed and processed.', '2015-02-21 17:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319462, 1142076, 97225, '<td valign="top">Artsee indeed!</td>', 'Artsee indeed!', '2015-02-21 17:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319463, 1142001, 32011, '<td valign="top">I love the processing of this image.  A key component to the emotion of this image.  The composition is wonderful.  The whole image makes me want to know more about what is going on in the moments either side of this one instance.  Beautiful.</td>', 'I love the processing of this image.  A key component to the emotion of this image.  The composition is wonderful.  The whole image makes me want to know more about what is going on in the moments either side of this one instance.  Beautiful.', '2015-02-21 17:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319464, 1142081, 97225, '<td valign="top">Poor little guy, abandoned with his bottles - an engaging image.</td>', 'Poor little guy, abandoned with his bottles - an engaging image.', '2015-02-21 17:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319465, 1141438, 97225, '<td valign="top">Interesting and aesthetically pleasing.</td>', 'Interesting and aesthetically pleasing.', '2015-02-21 17:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319466, 1141876, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2015-02-21 17:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319467, 1142101, 97225, '<td valign="top">Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely.', '2015-02-21 17:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319468, 1142009, 32011, '<td valign="top">Great image... I''m asking, who are these people? where are they going? Is it so hot that you need an umbrella.  I like the steps in the corrugated iron/Al sheets that make-up the wall/fence.  The graffiti behind, an expression of someone elses artistic impulses... a scream of defiance or non-conformance to societies expectations... a little bit of both?</td>', 'Great image... I''m asking, who are these people? where are they going? Is it so hot that you need an umbrella.  I like the steps in the corrugated iron/Al sheets that make-up the wall/fence.  The graffiti behind, an expression of someone elses artistic impulses... a scream of defiance or non-conformance to societies expectations... a little bit of both?', '2015-02-21 17:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319470, 1142035, 32011, '<td valign="top">This is a great image.  Makes me think of Ned Kelly, contemplating what may be about to transpire as corrupt law men come for him and his gang.  The background actually looks a lot like the area around Glenrowan where Ned made is last stand.  The composition is splendid... the processing perfectly add to the feel and emotion.</td>', 'This is a great image.  Makes me think of Ned Kelly, contemplating what may be about to transpire as corrupt law men come for him and his gang.  The background actually looks a lot like the area around Glenrowan where Ned made is last stand.  The composition is splendid... the processing perfectly add to the feel and emotion.', '2015-02-21 17:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319471, 1141023, 32011, '<td valign="top">Looking at things a different way... that''s what art is about... that''s what this is about.  Wonderful detail.  I love that I can see a foot under the water.  I REALLY love the bow waves coming off the front... this is fauna and fluid dynamics art at its best.</td>', 'Looking at things a different way... that''s what art is about... that''s what this is about.  Wonderful detail.  I love that I can see a foot under the water.  I REALLY love the bow waves coming off the front... this is fauna and fluid dynamics art at its best.', '2015-02-21 17:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319472, 1141861, 32011, '<td valign="top">I love art that tells a story, and this is a perfect example... there''s so much to look at, without it be busy and confusing.  It''s well balanced, and wonderfully processed.  Love this image.</td>', 'I love art that tells a story, and this is a perfect example... there''s so much to look at, without it be busy and confusing.  It''s well balanced, and wonderfully processed.  Love this image.', '2015-02-21 17:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319473, 1142037, 32011, '<td valign="top">Such simple structure, but such beauty.  Wonderful lines, and the feet anchor the viewer in reality... it''s not just some pretty shadows, but something many people would have walk on and past without noticing the beautiful patterns, and play of light.  Thankfully, there was a photographer that wasn''t too busy, or too engrossed in "real life", who had the time to appreciate and capture this for other to enjoy.</td>', 'Such simple structure, but such beauty.  Wonderful lines, and the feet anchor the viewer in reality... it''s not just some pretty shadows, but something many people would have walk on and past without noticing the beautiful patterns, and play of light.  Thankfully, there was a photographer that wasn''t too busy, or too engrossed in "real life", who had the time to appreciate and capture this for other to enjoy.', '2015-02-21 17:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319474, 1141552, 32011, '<td valign="top">I love the clouds and colours... the composition is wonderful.  I could see this on a wall of a little beach side cafe, with a "sold" sticker on it.</td>', 'I love the clouds and colours... the composition is wonderful.  I could see this on a wall of a little beach side cafe, with a "sold" sticker on it.', '2015-02-21 17:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319476, 1141082, 32011, '<td valign="top">This captures the absolute madness that is the highway system of the US... it doesn''t need to be this hard... this complicated... it shows modern societies "need" for shortcuts... direct, individual routes, but in the process of providing this, society creates a mess of roads that are impossible to navigate without GPS, and even then, one often finds themselves in the wrong lane or on the wrong off-ramp and heading in the completely opposite direction we need to be heading.</td>', 'This captures the absolute madness that is the highway system of the US... it doesn''t need to be this hard... this complicated... it shows modern societies "need" for shortcuts... direct, individual routes, but in the process of providing this, society creates a mess of roads that are impossible to navigate without GPS, and even then, one often finds themselves in the wrong lane or on the wrong off-ramp and heading in the completely opposite direction we need to be heading.', '2015-02-21 18:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319477, 1141931, 32011, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  The composition/crop is great, and the image works fantastic in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Great capture.  The composition/crop is great, and the image works fantastic in B&W.', '2015-02-21 18:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319478, 1141798, 32011, '<td valign="top">Wonderful detail and composition.  The beauty and art of this was largely lost on first viewing... but having returned to comment, I sit here and am noticing a lot that I overlooked before.  It still has the gross factor, but art does that sometimes... makes us uncomfortable.</td>', 'Wonderful detail and composition.  The beauty and art of this was largely lost on first viewing... but having returned to comment, I sit here and am noticing a lot that I overlooked before.  It still has the gross factor, but art does that sometimes... makes us uncomfortable.', '2015-02-21 18:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319479, 1141791, 32011, '<td valign="top">I love a good spiral staircase, and this is a great spiral staircase, and you''ve done an excellent job with the processing and composition.</td>', 'I love a good spiral staircase, and this is a great spiral staircase, and you''ve done an excellent job with the processing and composition.', '2015-02-21 18:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319480, 1141940, 32011, '<td valign="top">A great capture.  The juxtaposition is wonderful...</td>', 'A great capture.  The juxtaposition is wonderful...', '2015-02-21 18:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319485, 1142018, 119419, '<td valign="top">A clever scene of alternate coca cola and designer water bottles coupled with organic floral displays reminiscent of Bernie Bostons 1967 photo of George Harris placing flowers into the rifle barrels of military police at an anti-war rally. There is a subtle oddness in the scene with the alternate tables and the mismatched chairs. It is more of a study than a statement. It sits quietly and patiently for the players in an unplayed scene, laughter and wine, stories untold, tears and tales, reunions and separations.</td>', 'A clever scene of alternate coca cola and designer water bottles coupled with organic floral displays reminiscent of Bernie Bostons 1967 photo of George Harris placing flowers into the rifle barrels of military police at an anti-war rally. There is a subtle oddness in the scene with the alternate tables and the mismatched chairs. It is more of a study than a statement. It sits quietly and patiently for the players in an unplayed scene, laughter and wine, stories untold, tears and tales, reunions and separations.', '2015-02-21 18:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319486, 1141368, 119419, '<td valign="top">A most wonderful title coupled with quite a heart-warming scene.  And it has such a pleasant compositional balance. It evokes freshness of life and vitality with slightly comic overtones.</td>', 'A most wonderful title coupled with quite a heart-warming scene.  And it has such a pleasant compositional balance. It evokes freshness of life and vitality with slightly comic overtones.', '2015-02-21 18:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319489, 1141095, 119419, '<td valign="top">A moment in time, a juxtaposition of the older and the younger  touching, reaching, being ready for interaction, an offer of assistance, a request for help, elements of interactive anticipation through the triangulation of hands. I think the hands speak volumes towards the mood and intentions of the subjects, a story so loudly unspoken in its familial affirmation and gestures of emotional sensitivity.</td>', 'A moment in time, a juxtaposition of the older and the younger  touching, reaching, being ready for interaction, an offer of assistance, a request for help, elements of interactive anticipation through the triangulation of hands. I think the hands speak volumes towards the mood and intentions of the subjects, a story so loudly unspoken in its familial affirmation and gestures of emotional sensitivity.', '2015-02-21 18:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319491, 1142083, 23098, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene.</td>', 'Beautiful scene.', '2015-02-21 18:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319492, 1141802, 119419, '<td valign="top">Probably a top 5 if not a winner. Joyousness, freedom, cute, cuddly, real and rapturous. I''m suspecting Anita or Clive but who knows. A very beautiful and engaging image, well processed and well crafted, apart from that little branch upper left, but I won''t mention that - bad dog me ;). Thank you for this, it lifts the spirits immensely and reassures me of the beauty that resides in human nature.</td>', 'Probably a top 5 if not a winner. Joyousness, freedom, cute, cuddly, real and rapturous. I''m suspecting Anita or Clive but who knows. A very beautiful and engaging image, well processed and well crafted, apart from that little branch upper left, but I won''t mention that - bad dog me ;). Thank you for this, it lifts the spirits immensely and reassures me of the beauty that resides in human nature.', '2015-02-21 18:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319493, 1141867, 23098, '<td valign="top">Very artful, nice rich colors.</td>', 'Very artful, nice rich colors.', '2015-02-21 18:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319496, 1142094, 119419, '<td valign="top">I know who you are and where you live ;) There is so much to love and enjoy about this image it is hard to know where to start. Even the subtle shaping of the baseball field model reflects the composition as a whole, the childhood aura that pervades is intensely nostalgic while in the immediacy of now.</td>', 'I know who you are and where you live ;) There is so much to love and enjoy about this image it is hard to know where to start. Even the subtle shaping of the baseball field model reflects the composition as a whole, the childhood aura that pervades is intensely nostalgic while in the immediacy of now.', '2015-02-21 18:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319499, 1141385, 23098, '<td valign="top">Really like this, especially the processing and interesting comp.</td>', 'Really like this, especially the processing and interesting comp.', '2015-02-21 18:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319501, 1141385, 119419, '<td valign="top">This has such a good compositional value. Quirky and balanced, oddly compelling. It makes me want to be involved in the action and look forward to the outcome. Nice choice of processing as well.</td>', 'This has such a good compositional value. Quirky and balanced, oddly compelling. It makes me want to be involved in the action and look forward to the outcome. Nice choice of processing as well.', '2015-02-21 18:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319508, 1142001, 23098, '<td valign="top">excellent, should be in the top 10.</td>', 'excellent, should be in the top 10.', '2015-02-21 18:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319513, 1142095, 68504, '<td valign="top">someone''s prayin'' Lord, someone''s texting... time to get those peeps outside! carpe diem.</td>', 'someone''s prayin'' Lord, someone''s texting... time to get those peeps outside! carpe diem.', '2015-02-21 19:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
