(7319529, 1141894, 96751, '<td valign="top">Sch gentle tones in a fierce landscape</td>', 'Sch gentle tones in a fierce landscape', '2015-02-21 19:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319531, 1141282, 96751, '<td valign="top">Spectacular image. The extreme contrast is perfect. I feel like they''re exploring an alien planet</td>', 'Spectacular image. The extreme contrast is perfect. I feel like they''re exploring an alien planet', '2015-02-21 19:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319532, 1141131, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but it seems too sharp. I think it would have look better softer... (plus, the original colors were gorgeous. I don''t know about the b&amp;w. Somehow this scene looks very familiar... :)</td>', 'I like the idea, but it seems too sharp. I think it would have look better softer... (plus, the original colors were gorgeous. I don''t know about the b&w. Somehow this scene looks very familiar... :)', '2015-02-21 19:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319533, 1141954, 63218, '<td valign="top">hooray for the abstracts! I''m just enjoying this one without trying to figure anything out.</td>', 'hooray for the abstracts! I''m just enjoying this one without trying to figure anything out.', '2015-02-21 19:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319534, 1141849, 63218, '<td valign="top">the sky is a wall, the earth is a stage where nothing is happening</td>', 'the sky is a wall, the earth is a stage where nothing is happening', '2015-02-21 19:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319535, 1141855, 103142, '<td valign="top">Normally I find nature shots to be more documentary that art, however, there''s such a great expression and feeling of resignation on the face -- it says a lot more to me than a normal animal shot.<br/> <br/>That being said, The background is oversharp -- it works on the beastie, but you''re getting weird halos around the rocks.</td>', 'Normally I find nature shots to be more documentary that art, however, there''s such a great expression and feeling of resignation on the face -- it says a lot more to me than a normal animal shot. That being said, The background is oversharp -- it works on the beastie, but you''re getting weird halos around the rocks.', '2015-02-21 19:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319537, 1141959, 63218, '<td valign="top">this is so...unexplainable &amp; yet so clear &amp; concise, it makes me smile inside</td>', 'this is so...unexplainable & yet so clear & concise, it makes me smile inside', '2015-02-21 19:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319538, 1141368, 103142, '<td valign="top">I think the story works well for art. There''s a lot to explore and a lot to discover. However, the photo itself doesn''t really work. While it''s a great story, I find the image itself lacking. The dark lower right corner, and the very bright trees all draw your eyes to the wrong places.</td>', 'I think the story works well for art. There''s a lot to explore and a lot to discover. However, the photo itself doesn''t really work. While it''s a great story, I find the image itself lacking. The dark lower right corner, and the very bright trees all draw your eyes to the wrong places.', '2015-02-21 19:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319539, 1141735, 103142, '<td valign="top">It''s a cool image that works well for a documentary type photo, but I''m not sure it works as art for me. Art, imo, should make you feel something -- curiosity, excitement, intrigue, anger, etc. Something that draws you in and keeps you coming back over and over again. While this is beautiful, and the colors are lovely, once I''ve seen it, it doesn''t draw me back to explore more.</td>', 'It''s a cool image that works well for a documentary type photo, but I''m not sure it works as art for me. Art, imo, should make you feel something -- curiosity, excitement, intrigue, anger, etc. Something that draws you in and keeps you coming back over and over again. While this is beautiful, and the colors are lovely, once I''ve seen it, it doesn''t draw me back to explore more.', '2015-02-21 19:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319540, 1141282, 63218, '<td valign="top">the clouds are like a tent</td>', 'the clouds are like a tent', '2015-02-21 19:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319542, 1141395, 170018, '<td valign="top">That''s awesome! I want to hear a story behind this photo!</td>', 'That''s awesome! I want to hear a story behind this photo!', '2015-02-21 19:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
