(7319556, 1142101, 63218, '<td valign="top">The horiz element must''ve been created by the hilltop, it''s an interesting effect, like what you might notice just before the alien abduction occurs.</td>', 'The horiz element must''ve been created by the hilltop, it''s an interesting effect, like what you might notice just before the alien abduction occurs.', '2015-02-21 19:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
