(7319776, 1141561, 104230, '<td valign="top">There is something about kitchen window views that I enjoy. Perhaps it comes from being so aware of how much that view varies through the seasons and time of day.<br/>I find myself wondering if those are tree shadows or silhouettes, but it doesn''t matter. Just an idle thought. Somehow this image conveys both chaos and calm. In my top 10.</td>', 'There is something about kitchen window views that I enjoy. Perhaps it comes from being so aware of how much that view varies through the seasons and time of day.I find myself wondering if those are tree shadows or silhouettes, but it doesn''t matter. Just an idle thought. Somehow this image conveys both chaos and calm. In my top 10.', '2015-02-21 23:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7319777, 1141944, 124815, '<td valign="top">This frightful cosmic image is destabilized a little by the use of a vignette. Unless one chooses to read the vignette as a defect of ones own peripheral vision. <br/>The choice of grey is excellent taking the image out of a simple texture exercise. I believe that this photograph shall be seen in a small scale and additional images shall accompany it. A photo essay will suit it a lot.</td>', 'This frightful cosmic image is destabilized a little by the use of a vignette. Unless one chooses to read the vignette as a defect of ones own peripheral vision. The choice of grey is excellent taking the image out of a simple texture exercise. I believe that this photograph shall be seen in a small scale and additional images shall accompany it. A photo essay will suit it a lot.', '2015-02-21 23:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
