(7319844, 1142001, 75618, '<td valign="top">I really love this outtake much more than the other one. Great dynamic composition and beautiful warm tones. The out of focus flock of gulls and seemingly out of place pole/cross add some visual interest and mystery. Congratulations on the ribbon!!!</td>', 'I really love this outtake much more than the other one. Great dynamic composition and beautiful warm tones. The out of focus flock of gulls and seemingly out of place pole/cross add some visual interest and mystery. Congratulations on the ribbon!!!', '2015-02-22 03:42:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(7319845, 1141802, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by daisydavid:</b></div><hr/><i> Probably a top 5 if not a winner. Joyousness, freedom, cute, cuddly, real and rapturous. I''m suspecting Anita or Clive but who knows. A very beautiful and engaging image, well processed and well crafted, apart from that little branch upper left, but I won''t mention that - bad dog me ;). Thank you for this, it lifts the spirits immensely and reassures me of the beauty that resides in human nature. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>That''s a compliment thanks.<br/> <br/>Glad it got into the TT<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2015-02-22 03:46:09.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by daisydavid: Probably a top 5 if not a winner. Joyousness, freedom, cute, cuddly, real and rapturous. I''m suspecting Anita or Clive but who knows. A very beautiful and engaging image, well processed and well crafted, apart from that little branch upper left, but I won''t mention that - bad dog me ;). Thank you for this, it lifts the spirits immensely and reassures me of the beauty that resides in human nature.   That''s a compliment thanks. Glad it got into the TT', '2015-02-22 03:45:44.000000', '2015-02-22 03:46:09.000000', 0),
