(7319853, 1141800, 102278, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mariuca:</b></div><hr/><i> Ive read this sentence before somewhere and had to google it; its a title of a book in Oprahs reading club. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Gosh, I didn''t know that. I assumed it was something out of the bible I''d half remembered. Perhaps I was in Oprahs club in a previous life.</td>', 'Originally posted by mariuca: Ive read this sentence before somewhere and had to google it; its a title of a book in Oprahs reading club.   Gosh, I didn''t know that. I assumed it was something out of the bible I''d half remembered. Perhaps I was in Oprahs club in a previous life.', '2015-02-22 04:58:21.000000', NULL, 0),
