(7319861, 1141983, 138253, '<td valign="top">Glad this acted as intended.<br/>to me, art makes you stop, it demands you inspect it.<br/>it is not always pretty, and it does not always require lengthy exploration, but it isn''t something to be glossed over.</td>', 'Glad this acted as intended.to me, art makes you stop, it demands you inspect it.it is not always pretty, and it does not always require lengthy exploration, but it isn''t something to be glossed over.', '2015-02-22 07:18:24.000000', NULL, 0),
