(7319885, 1142080, 83149, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tanguera:</b></div><hr/><i> What a title! What a pose </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks, I have to give the credit for the title to my daughter.  I was struggling for a meaningful title and had to get some suggestions from my wife and daughter.</td>', 'Originally posted by tanguera: What a title! What a pose   Thanks, I have to give the credit for the title to my daughter.  I was struggling for a meaningful title and had to get some suggestions from my wife and daughter.', '2015-02-22 08:25:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(7319887, 1140964, 23098, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, congrats on the blue!</td>', 'Beautiful, congrats on the blue!', '2015-02-22 08:50:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(7319888, 1142001, 23098, '<td valign="top">Congrats, one of my favorites.</td>', 'Congrats, one of my favorites.', '2015-02-22 08:52:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(7319889, 1141990, 109227, '<td valign="top">I really like this image a lot, especially the setting.  It has all the elements of a good story and a striking image. However, he stark color of the dress draws all of my attention. I think if she was wearing something a little softer in color to blend in with the environment it would, imo, look better.   I am just an amateur photog and I tend to like muted colors, so take this with a grain of salt.</td>', 'I really like this image a lot, especially the setting.  It has all the elements of a good story and a striking image. However, he stark color of the dress draws all of my attention. I think if she was wearing something a little softer in color to blend in with the environment it would, imo, look better.   I am just an amateur photog and I tend to like muted colors, so take this with a grain of salt.', '2015-02-22 08:54:57.000000', NULL, 0),
