(7319991, 1141990, 2553, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 5, and pretty much for the same reasons as others stated.  I loved the old building and the soft feel and I like what I perceive the concept to be, but the distraction of the dress, both in color and in the busy design was almost overwhelming for the rest of the image.   I just felt the image needed something to make it more cohesive.</td>', 'I gave this a 5, and pretty much for the same reasons as others stated.  I loved the old building and the soft feel and I like what I perceive the concept to be, but the distraction of the dress, both in color and in the busy design was almost overwhelming for the rest of the image.   I just felt the image needed something to make it more cohesive.', '2015-02-22 13:37:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(7319992, 1142001, 2553, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!  Love this, it is a very appealing image!<br/></td>', 'Congratulations!  Love this, it is a very appealing image!', '2015-02-22 13:39:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(7319995, 1142074, 100831, '<td valign="top">funny... the two of them. And you too for the imagination. Thanks for the laugh.</td>', 'funny... the two of them. And you too for the imagination. Thanks for the laugh.', '2015-02-22 13:42:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(7319996, 1141282, 2553, '<td valign="top">I loved this, was drawn in immediately by the stark contrast and the looming skies, then I noticed the people...awesome!  One of my 10''s for the challenge.<br/></td>', 'I loved this, was drawn in immediately by the stark contrast and the looming skies, then I noticed the people...awesome!  One of my 10''s for the challenge.', '2015-02-22 13:42:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(7319997, 1141802, 2553, '<td valign="top">Not quite contrasty enough for my taste, but it is a superb image.  Just looking at it makes you happy.  Lovely and well done.</td>', 'Not quite contrasty enough for my taste, but it is a superb image.  Just looking at it makes you happy.  Lovely and well done.', '2015-02-22 13:44:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(7320002, 1141104, 104230, '<td valign="top">An interesting similarity between the museum guard and the woman that I just noticed is that they''re both holding their hands behind their back.<br/> <br/>However, the woman''s stillness and the guard''s movement and watchfulness feel so very different. They provide a lovely contrast.  Great image, sweetie!</td>', 'An interesting similarity between the museum guard and the woman that I just noticed is that they''re both holding their hands behind their back. However, the woman''s stillness and the guard''s movement and watchfulness feel so very different. They provide a lovely contrast.  Great image, sweetie!', '2015-02-22 14:29:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(7320006, 1142001, 30214, '<td valign="top">Inspired composition. Congrats on the ribbon Mark!</td>', 'Inspired composition. Congrats on the ribbon Mark!', '2015-02-22 14:39:58.000000', NULL, 0),
