(7320008, 1141104, 32011, '<td valign="top">Commenting as part of my commitment to Team Suck:<br/> <br/>I commented on this during voting, and there''s little more I can add.  Fact that I commented previously, automatically tells you it was in my top 25% for the challenge.  Well done on a wonderful image.</td>', 'Commenting as part of my commitment to Team Suck: I commented on this during voting, and there''s little more I can add.  Fact that I commented previously, automatically tells you it was in my top 25% for the challenge.  Well done on a wonderful image.', '2015-02-22 14:41:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(7320009, 1140964, 30490, '<td valign="top">Congrats!  A wonderful photo and very deserving of the blue!</td>', 'Congrats!  A wonderful photo and very deserving of the blue!', '2015-02-22 14:47:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(7320010, 1142090, 32011, '<td valign="top">Commenting as part of my commitment to Team Suck: <br/> <br/>I commented on this during voting, which automatically tells you it was in my top 25% for the challenge. In fact, it''s in my top 5 favourites for the challenge.  As I said, this reminds me of nixter, and that I rate him as one of the great artists here... you Deb, are another of the great artists here.<br/> <br/>While the voters didn''t give this image the appreciation it deserves, at least I don''t think they did, but one conciliation is that in doing so, your image can now get a MUAIMHO (along with the other deserving accolades being bestowed). <br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png"/></td>', 'Commenting as part of my commitment to Team Suck:  I commented on this during voting, which automatically tells you it was in my top 25% for the challenge. In fact, it''s in my top 5 favourites for the challenge.  As I said, this reminds me of nixter, and that I rate him as one of the great artists here... you Deb, are another of the great artists here. While the voters didn''t give this image the appreciation it deserves, at least I don''t think they did, but one conciliation is that in doing so, your image can now get a MUAIMHO (along with the other deserving accolades being bestowed).  ', '2015-02-22 14:49:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(7320011, 1141983, 30490, '<td valign="top">My initial reaction to this image was not real positive, but then I took into account that this is an ART challenge and I figured that anyone who took the time to enter a "non-traditional" photo was in fact being artistic!  So I think the jarringness (is that a word?) of the photo is part of your intended process.  <br/> <br/>I would suggest that you clone out your sensor dust in the future.  The spots are a bit distracting.</td>', 'My initial reaction to this image was not real positive, but then I took into account that this is an ART challenge and I figured that anyone who took the time to enter a "non-traditional" photo was in fact being artistic!  So I think the jarringness (is that a word?) of the photo is part of your intended process.   I would suggest that you clone out your sensor dust in the future.  The spots are a bit distracting.', '2015-02-22 14:51:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(7320012, 1142071, 30490, '<td valign="top">I liked this image and gave it a "7".  I liked the iridescent look to the beads and I know how hard it can be to get a good image of this type of subject.  Obviously the rest of the voters didn''t appreciate it, but I want you to know I did!</td>', 'I liked this image and gave it a "7".  I liked the iridescent look to the beads and I know how hard it can be to get a good image of this type of subject.  Obviously the rest of the voters didn''t appreciate it, but I want you to know I did!', '2015-02-22 14:54:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(7320013, 1141180, 30490, '<td valign="top">Didn''t get around to commenting on this in the challenge....<br/> <br/>Funny thing is the thumb nail for this image jumped out at me right away.  It was one of the fist images I viewed in the challenge.  But, I didn''t like it as much full size....  something got a bit lost from thumbnail to  full size.  I think stainless is really hard to photograph, and maybe that is the issue.  The composition of the shot was interesting but the relationship of the background to the subject got muddied.</td>', 'Didn''t get around to commenting on this in the challenge.... Funny thing is the thumb nail for this image jumped out at me right away.  It was one of the fist images I viewed in the challenge.  But, I didn''t like it as much full size....  something got a bit lost from thumbnail to  full size.  I think stainless is really hard to photograph, and maybe that is the issue.  The composition of the shot was interesting but the relationship of the background to the subject got muddied.', '2015-02-22 14:58:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(7320014, 1141513, 32011, '<td valign="top">Commenting as part of my commitment to Team Suck:<br/> <br/>On second viewing, it is indeed an interesting photo... unfortunately, there wasn''t the draw on first viewing and voting to make me want to look too long and hard at this. The processing seemed harsh, but given the subject, that''s probably fitting.  Also, I tend not to look at the titles of all the photos, and had I read this title, it would have compelled me to go and look for the hat... which would have led me to fully appreciate the moment you captured.  I apologies for not giving this the attention it deserved earlier...</td>', 'Commenting as part of my commitment to Team Suck: On second viewing, it is indeed an interesting photo... unfortunately, there wasn''t the draw on first viewing and voting to make me want to look too long and hard at this. The processing seemed harsh, but given the subject, that''s probably fitting.  Also, I tend not to look at the titles of all the photos, and had I read this title, it would have compelled me to go and look for the hat... which would have led me to fully appreciate the moment you captured.  I apologies for not giving this the attention it deserved earlier...', '2015-02-22 15:00:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(7320015, 1141273, 30490, '<td valign="top">I liked this image, sorry it didn''t do better overall.  I like the colors and the interesting path of the road.  I guess I am just a sucker for strong leading lines and roads!!  The sky is quite nice too.</td>', 'I liked this image, sorry it didn''t do better overall.  I like the colors and the interesting path of the road.  I guess I am just a sucker for strong leading lines and roads!!  The sky is quite nice too.', '2015-02-22 15:00:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(7320016, 1141581, 68504, '<td valign="top">"it had to be you"</td>', '"it had to be you"', '2015-02-22 15:01:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(7320017, 1141194, 30490, '<td valign="top">Interesting comment on how monitor settings and light change this image.  This is a big problem for me right now, so I can feel your pain.  <br/> <br/>For me the reddish cast to the image was a bit distracting.  Great attempt at defining what is art to you!</td>', 'Interesting comment on how monitor settings and light change this image.  This is a big problem for me right now, so I can feel your pain.   For me the reddish cast to the image was a bit distracting.  Great attempt at defining what is art to you!', '2015-02-22 15:03:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(7320018, 1141934, 30490, '<td valign="top">Didn''t have time to comment during the challenge.... <br/> <br/>I really like this image.  The colors are very pleasing and I love the detail of the veins in the petal in the upper right corner.<br/> <br/>I thought this was spot on for this art challenge and gave you a 7.  If I hadn''t had computer problems I would have bumped this to at least an 8.</td>', 'Didn''t have time to comment during the challenge....  I really like this image.  The colors are very pleasing and I love the detail of the veins in the petal in the upper right corner. I thought this was spot on for this art challenge and gave you a 7.  If I hadn''t had computer problems I would have bumped this to at least an 8.', '2015-02-22 15:06:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(7320020, 1141855, 30490, '<td valign="top">This image scored exactly as it deserved.  For some reason (I''m working on it!) my monitor didn''t show the horrible halos in the background before I uploaded it.  Thank you to everyone who commented.  I loved this subject, and will go back to the drawing board with processing this image!</td>', 'This image scored exactly as it deserved.  For some reason (I''m working on it!) my monitor didn''t show the horrible halos in the background before I uploaded it.  Thank you to everyone who commented.  I loved this subject, and will go back to the drawing board with processing this image!', '2015-02-22 15:08:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(7320021, 1142094, 32011, '<td valign="top">Commenting as part of my commitment to Team Suck:<br/> <br/>I quite like this image.... I like the story it is trying to tell.  I like the processing.  I can see it as a work of art that could grace the wall of the boy or his family, however, it wasn''t something that I could see hanging in a gallery of on an album.  I didn''t impact, or connect with ME as much as many of the other photo... a wonderful image, nonetheless.</td>', 'Commenting as part of my commitment to Team Suck: I quite like this image.... I like the story it is trying to tell.  I like the processing.  I can see it as a work of art that could grace the wall of the boy or his family, however, it wasn''t something that I could see hanging in a gallery of on an album.  I didn''t impact, or connect with ME as much as many of the other photo... a wonderful image, nonetheless.', '2015-02-22 15:09:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(7320023, 1141854, 32011, '<td valign="top">Commenting as part of my commitment to Team Suck:<br/> <br/>Disorientation is not the feeling I expect when looking at art, but you managed to evoke this.  An interesting way of making the viewer look at something differently.</td>', 'Commenting as part of my commitment to Team Suck: Disorientation is not the feeling I expect when looking at art, but you managed to evoke this.  An interesting way of making the viewer look at something differently.', '2015-02-22 15:11:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(7320024, 1140995, 32011, '<td valign="top">Commenting as part of my commitment to Team Suck:<br/> <br/>A pretty garden, and the processing makes it look like a work of art by one of the European masters.</td>', 'Commenting as part of my commitment to Team Suck: A pretty garden, and the processing makes it look like a work of art by one of the European masters.', '2015-02-22 15:13:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(7320025, 1141934, 32011, '<td valign="top">Commenting as part of my commitment to Team Suck:<br/> <br/>An interesting macro.  Lovely colours and composition.  Just lacks something to hook the viewing into sticking around a little longer to immerse themselves in it (IMHO).</td>', 'Commenting as part of my commitment to Team Suck: An interesting macro.  Lovely colours and composition.  Just lacks something to hook the viewing into sticking around a little longer to immerse themselves in it (IMHO).', '2015-02-22 15:16:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(7320026, 1141965, 32011, '<td valign="top">Commenting as part of my commitment to Team Suck:<br/> <br/>I like this.  It reminds me of an image I took back in uni when I did a photography elective, and I spun around my lounge room with a long exposure... magical, mysterious results. Only when you look at this for some time do you begin to see what may have been there... nice.</td>', 'Commenting as part of my commitment to Team Suck: I like this.  It reminds me of an image I took back in uni when I did a photography elective, and I spun around my lounge room with a long exposure... magical, mysterious results. Only when you look at this for some time do you begin to see what may have been there... nice.', '2015-02-22 15:19:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(7320027, 1141980, 32011, '<td valign="top">Commenting as part of my commitment to Team Suck:<br/> <br/>Beautiful colours and composition.  Great use of shallow DOF.</td>', 'Commenting as part of my commitment to Team Suck: Beautiful colours and composition.  Great use of shallow DOF.', '2015-02-22 15:21:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7320028, 1141890, 32011, '<td valign="top">Commenting as part of my commitment to Team Suck:<br/> <br/>I struggle to connect with this on any level... but I guess that''s art.  One man''s masterpiece, etc...  Don''t get me wrong, I didn''t hate it, but it just didn''t grab me in any way.</td>', 'Commenting as part of my commitment to Team Suck: I struggle to connect with this on any level... but I guess that''s art.  One man''s masterpiece, etc...  Don''t get me wrong, I didn''t hate it, but it just didn''t grab me in any way.', '2015-02-22 15:23:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(7320030, 1141732, 32011, '<td valign="top">Commenting as part of my commitment to Team Suck:<br/> <br/>I really like the processing. You can''t help yourself with the birds, can you.  :)</td>', 'Commenting as part of my commitment to Team Suck: I really like the processing. You can''t help yourself with the birds, can you.  :)', '2015-02-22 15:31:33.000000', NULL, 0),
