(7320042, 1141513, 63218, '<td valign="top">It reminds me of a pencil drawing. So I wonder if it lost a point here &amp; there because of that--people might''ve thought you relied on PP to make it look artistic. I don''t know, but that''s why I didn''t use noticeable PP in this challenge.  Anyway, I found the hat. Even now that I know what it is, for some reason, I still have trouble seeing it as a hat. My poor brain. I like the row of spectators'' eyes behind the fence. See ya in the next challenge!</td>', 'It reminds me of a pencil drawing. So I wonder if it lost a point here & there because of that--people might''ve thought you relied on PP to make it look artistic. I don''t know, but that''s why I didn''t use noticeable PP in this challenge.  Anyway, I found the hat. Even now that I know what it is, for some reason, I still have trouble seeing it as a hat. My poor brain. I like the row of spectators'' eyes behind the fence. See ya in the next challenge!', '2015-02-22 16:04:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(7320043, 1141947, 24454, '<td valign="top">I think this is absolutely wonderful!</td>', 'I think this is absolutely wonderful!', '2015-02-22 16:05:06.000000', NULL, 0),
