(7320076, 1141404, 32011, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the HM.  This is my favourite image of the challenge.  I gave it a 10... would have given it an 11 if I could.</td>', 'Congratulations on the HM.  This is my favourite image of the challenge.  I gave it a 10... would have given it an 11 if I could.', '2015-02-22 17:16:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(7320109, 1141960, 119419, '<td valign="top">Such a wonderful use classic shapes, lines and curves. The mans gaze beckons us to an off view event, we are distracted by his distraction, his alignment with the lines of stonework for some other event. Perhaps the corkscrew shaped manicured bush implies a possible emerging event, not unlike the arrival of HG Wells mole drilling machine from Journey to the Centre of the Earth. The whole scene creates a quaint tension between the movements of competing stories.</td>', 'Such a wonderful use classic shapes, lines and curves. The mans gaze beckons us to an off view event, we are distracted by his distraction, his alignment with the lines of stonework for some other event. Perhaps the corkscrew shaped manicured bush implies a possible emerging event, not unlike the arrival of HG Wells mole drilling machine from Journey to the Centre of the Earth. The whole scene creates a quaint tension between the movements of competing stories.', '2015-02-22 18:15:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(7320124, 1141013, 114285, '<td valign="top">I quite liked this Ammie, processed beautifully., the spirally shadows on the bridge slithering around ...but it didn''t draw me in a make me think too hard. I gave it a six, could of pushed it to a seven if maybe the crop was landscape and I could see the lonely figure clearer. <br/> <br/>I think you should be happy with your comments, hey you even got one from Don.<br/> <br/>I think you''ll be back though, enjoy your break, and see you soon.</td>', 'I quite liked this Ammie, processed beautifully., the spirally shadows on the bridge slithering around ...but it didn''t draw me in a make me think too hard. I gave it a six, could of pushed it to a seven if maybe the crop was landscape and I could see the lonely figure clearer.  I think you should be happy with your comments, hey you even got one from Don. I think you''ll be back though, enjoy your break, and see you soon.', '2015-02-22 19:28:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(7320125, 1142090, 114285, '<td valign="top">I can see why everyone liked this so much, WD! I nearly entered an image of an elderly lady looking out the window from her seat in a plane, might post it in outtakes later.<br/> <br/>Congrats on all the blingetgy bling!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2015-02-22 19:34:23.</i></td>', 'I can see why everyone liked this so much, WD! I nearly entered an image of an elderly lady looking out the window from her seat in a plane, might post it in outtakes later. Congrats on all the blingetgy bling!', '2015-02-22 19:31:28.000000', '2015-02-22 19:34:23.000000', 0),
